window.KODHE_SEARCH_INDEX = [{"url": "landing.html", "title": "Kodhe Framework User Guide", "section": "General", "text": "<! Per language table of contents: since the user guide is organized \"one folder per language\", the TOC lives in each language folder as its own README: user guide/en/index.md (English) user guide/id/index.md (Bahasa Indonesia) This root file is only a short bilingual landing page pointing at both. The HTML build (scripts/build user guide.py) renders each <lang /index.md as <lang /index.html and uses en/index.md (DEFAULT LANG) for the root index.html. <! LANG SWITCH Kodhe Framework User Guide This is the bilingual landing page of the user guide. The full table of contents is maintained per language — one README/index file inside each language folder: 🇬🇧 English: en/index.md 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia: id/index.md Halaman ini adalah pengantar dua bahasa dari user guide. Daftar isi lengkap dikelola per bahasa — satu berkas README/daftar isi di dalam tiap folder bahasa: 🇬🇧 Inggris: en/index.md 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia: id/index.md Language Structure / Struktur Bahasa This user guide consists of two language folders , each containing a full guide — including its own table of contents page (<lang /index.md, the \"README\" of that language) — in its own language: User guide ini terdiri dari dua folder bahasa , masing masing berisi panduan lengkap — termasuk halaman daftar isi sendiri (<lang /index.md, \"README\" nya bahasa tersebut) — sesuai bahasanya: Folder Language Per language TOC file Contents en/ 🇬🇧 English en/index.md concepts/, general/, libraries/ — fully translated ✅ id/ 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia id/index.md concepts/, general/, libraries/ Folder Bahasa Berkas daftar isi per bahasa Isi en/ 🇬🇧 Inggris en/index.md concepts/, general/, libraries/ id/ 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia id/index.md concepts/, general/, libraries/ — penuh Open the README inside the language folder you want; that README carries the full table of contents for that language. In the HTML site built by scripts/build user guide.py, each <lang /index.md becomes <lang /index.html with an ID · EN switcher in the header. Buka README di dalam folder bahasa yang Anda inginkan; README itulah yang memuat daftar isi lengkap untuk bahasa tersebut. Di situs HTML hasil scripts/build user guide.py, setiap <lang /index.md menjadi <lang /index.html dengan pemilih ID · EN di header. The path structure of both folders is identical (e.g. id/libraries/session.md ↔ en/libraries/session.md), so cross language links are always available. Struktur path kedua folder identik (mis. id/libraries/session.md ↔ en/libraries/session.md), sehingga tautan silang antar bahasa selalu tersedia. Main difference vs CI3: every library is a separate Composer package with the namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\ . Install only the packages you need; there is no more mandatory $this load library() for every feature. Perbedaan utama dengan CI3: setiap library adalah paket Composer terpisah dengan namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\ . Anda cukup memasang paket yang dibutuhkan; tidak ada lagi $this load library() wajib untuk semua fitur. Quick Links / Tautan Cepat English Bahasa Indonesia Table of Contents Daftar Isi Installation Instalasi New Project Proyek Baru Library Index Indeks Library Security Keamanan Migrating from CI3 Migrasi dari CI3 Documentation Source Hierarchy / Hierarki Sumber Dokumentasi 1. user guide/<lang /index.md — per language table of contents & learning narrative (en/ English, id/ Bahasa Indonesia). Daftar isi & narasi pembelajaran per bahasa. 2. user guide/<lang /<subfolder / .md — the actual guide pages, one folder per language. Halaman panduan sebenarnya, satu folder per bahasa. 3. <package /README.md — canonical per package API reference (always the most current). Referensi API kanonik per paket (selalu paling mutakhir). 4. doc/ — historical archive, deprecated, do not use as a reference. Arsip historis, deprecated, jangan dijadikan rujukan."}, {"url": "index.html", "title": "Kodhe Framework User Guide", "section": "en", "text": "<! Per language table of contents for the English user guide (folder en/). This file is the \"README per bahasa\" of the English guide: rendered by scripts/build user guide.py to html/en/index.html and — because en is DEFAULT LANG — also to the root html/index.html. The Indonesian counterpart is ../id/index.md; the bilingual landing page is ../README.md. All relative links below are plain repo paths — they work both on GitHub (user guide/en/index.md) and in the built HTML site. <! LANG SWITCH Kodhe Framework User Guide Documentation for application development on top of the Kodhe Framework, organized following the CodeIgniter 3 User Guide structure — general topics , per package library reference , and linked index pages in every sub folder. This folder (en/) is the full English version; the Indonesian version lives in ../id/index.md. Structure by Language This user guide consists of two language folders , each containing a full guide in its own language: Folder Language Contents en/ 🇬🇧 English concepts/, general/, libraries/ — fully translated ✅ ../id/index.md 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia concepts/, general/, libraries/ The path structure of both folders is identical (e.g. id/libraries/session.md ↔ en/libraries/session.md), so cross language links are always available in the HTML site built by scripts/build user guide.py ( ID · EN switcher in the header). Main difference vs CI3: every library is a separate Composer package with the namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\ . Install only the packages you need; there is no more mandatory $this load library() for every feature. Table of Contents Core Concepts (concepts/) Document Contents architecture Modular package model, dual mode loader, service container installation Per package Composer vs root install, PSR 4 autoload, PHP requirements app components Standard Kodhe application components : controllers (App\\Controllers), models (Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model), libraries & multi engine views/templates — plus how to migrate each component from CI3 migrating from ci3 Step by step guide to moving a CI3 application (strategy, bootstrap, config, verification checklist, rollback) folder structure and routing ⚠️ Kodhe folder layout differences (Controllers/, no ) vs CI3, dual router (modern + legacy), coexistence strategy services modules routing Service container & providers, module system, modern routing, facades cli console Modern CLI Console (Console::getInstance(), base Command, make: ) + migrating CI3 is cli() cron jobs security 🔐 XSS, CSRF (config + how it works in the kernel & modern router), password hashing, encryption (migrate() for CI3 ciphertext), secure cookies/sessions, rate limiting (RateLimiter/ThrottleRequests), validation, CAPTCHA, pre production checklist namespaces migration Full CI / Kodhe\\Library\\ → Kodhe\\Framework\\ name map General Topics (general/) Document Contents new project Scaffold a project with php console new + run the dev server (serve) crud generator 🚀 make:crud — one command generates a complete CRUD set (model, controller, migration, views) + field types, route map, workflow running Framework bootstrap, configuration, running on the dev server troubleshooting Common error messages & their causes (class not found, table schema, etc.) Library Reference (libraries/) One page per package, format: purpose → installation → Quick Start → main API → migration notes from CI3 → link to the package README (source of technical truth). Category Package Page Core Components loader (kernel) Loader (Kernel) Web Services http (request/response/middleware) HTTP Web Services view (template engine) View Database queries/builders Database Database migrations Migration General Topics session Session General Topics auth Auth General Topics socialite Socialite General Topics email Email General Topics encrypt/encryption Encrypt / Encryption General Topics cache Cache General Topics driver (driver system) Driver System Help & Validation form validation Form Validation Help & Validation"}, {"url": "en/concepts/app-components.html", "title": "Kodhe Standard Application Components (Controllers, Models, Libraries, Views/Templates)", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Kodhe Standard Application Components (Controllers, Models, Libraries, Views/Templates) This page is the standard for writing application components in Kodhe Framework — the correct folders, namespaces, and base classes — together with how to migrate each component from CodeIgniter 3 . For the overall migration strategy see migrating from ci3; for folder structure & router differences see folder structure and routing. Quick summary Component Kodhe standard Legacy CI3 support CLI scaffold Controller app/Controllers/ .php, namespace App\\Controllers, extends Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Controllers\\BaseController $this load still available via Controller + LegacyLoader make:controller Model app/Models/ .php, namespace App\\Models, extends Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model Old extends CI Model keeps working as is make:model Library Direct instantiation new Kodhe\\Framework\\<Package \\<Class () or container $this load library('x') is mapped automatically by LegacyLoader — View/Template Global helper view() → Kodhe\\Framework\\View\\ViewFactory (PHP/Blade/Twig, layout, theme) $this load view() still works; old view folders can be reused — All Kodhe folder names use a leading capital letter and no underscores (Controllers, Models, Middleware) — the kernel autoloader tolerates case differences, but pure PSR 4 package mode demands full compliance. 1. Controller Kodhe standard Facts from the code (http/src/Controllers/): Controller (the base class) prepares the application Facade, stores a reference to the legacy controller ( legacy controller), and calls load initialize() so that $this load (CI3 style model/view/library/helper) keeps working inside modern controllers . BaseController adds optional auto loading (the string helper, the user agent library, theme registration when the kodhe/view package is installed). Every failure is fail soft (packages may be absent). RESTController is also available as a base class for APIs. Migration from CI3 CI3: Conversion steps: 1. Move the file into app/Controllers/ with a PascalCase file name matching the class (Welcome.php containing class Welcome). 2. Add namespace App\\Controllers; and use Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Controllers\\BaseController;, replace extends CI Controller → extends BaseController. 3. Public method names stay the same — both the legacy and the modern router will find them. By default the modern router looks for Home/Index/Main/Welcome as the front page controller. 4. $this load model()/view()/library()/helper() do not have to change in the first phase (they are mediated by LegacyLoader). Consolidate gradually: models → direct App\\Models\\... instantiation / DI, views → the view() helper, libraries → new Kodhe\\Framework\\... (see §3). 5. Register old routes to the new controllers if you use the modern router: ⚠️ Do not mix two controller namespaces in one file, and avoid underscores in class names (item model → ItemModel) to stay PSR 4 compliant. 2. Model Kodhe standard The modern model lives in the kodhe/database package: Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model (inheriting ORM\\LegacyModel) with declarative properties and a chainable query API. Main API (verified from database/src/Model.php): Query builder: select() where() orWhere() whereIn() like() orderBy() limit() groupBy() having() join() leftJoin() rightJoin() inRandomOrder() Eager relations: with(['category']) Execution: all() findAll($limit,$offset) first() find($id) findOrFail($id) count() sum() avg() max() min() chunk($size, fn) Writes: insert($data, $returnId) insertBatch() update($data, $where) updateBatch() delete($id) restore() forceDelete() truncate() Upserts: firstOrCreate() firstOrNew() updateOrCreate() The table can be swapped at runtime: $model table('items archive') Example usage in a controller: Migration from CI3 CI3: Conversion map: CI3 Kodhe class Item model extends CI Model (file item model.php) class ItemModel extends Model (file app/Models/ItemModel.php) $this db get('items') result() $this findAll() / ItemModel::all() $this db where(."}, {"url": "en/concepts/architecture.html", "title": "Architecture", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Architecture Kodhe Framework is the result of modularizing CodeIgniter 3 libraries into independent Composer packages under the Kodhe\\Framework\\ namespace (PSR 4), wrapped in a compatibility layer kernel (framework/) so legacy CI3 applications keep running. Layers Dual Mode Loader FileLoader supports two loading styles: 1. Legacy CI3 : $CI load library('user agent') — lowercase name, resolved through the internal packageMap to the modern FQCN (Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\UserAgent), then the CI class alias is created automatically so old code does not change. 2. Modern PSR 4 : use Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation; directly — recommended for new code; does not depend on the loader at all. Service Container framework/src/Config/Setup.php registers a factory per service (session, cache, database, etc.) that reads CI3 style configuration arrays ($config['sess driver'], $db['default'], …) and returns modern package instances. This is the bootstrap path used when the application boots. Package Principles No mandatory inter package dependencies unless truly needed (e.g. http → pagination for PaginationFactoryInterface). Every package is standalone installable: composer require kodhe/<package . The package README = source of truth for the API; user guide/ = learning narrative."}, {"url": "en/concepts/cli-console.html", "title": "CLI Console (Command Line)", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "CLI Console (Command Line) Kodhe Framework ships a built in Console component (framework/src/Console/, namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Console\\) for running development and maintenance tasks from the command line: code generation, migrations, clearing caches, jobs, and your own custom business commands. This is the modern console kernel (Symfony/Laravel style), different from the CI3 $this cli that was bound to URI segments. Old CI3 applications that use a CI Controller for CLI still run via the compatibility kernel — see §6 for how to migrate them. 1. Brief architecture Class Role Console The CLI application manager — a singleton (Console::getInstance()), command registry, run() execution Command Abstract base class for all commands; subclasses must implement handle(): int Input Parses argv tokens → positional/named arguments + options ( foo=bar, f) Output Coloured writer: writeln/info/success/warning/error/debug/table Commands\\HelpCommand help [command] — general or per command help Commands\\ListCommand list — lists all registered commands Commands\\VersionCommand version — the console application version Commands\\MakeCommand make: — boilerplate generators (see §5) The four commands above are registered automatically when a Console is created (registerDefaultCommands()). Custom commands are added via addCommand() / addCommands(). 2. Running the console Create a one time bootstrap in your project (e.g. bin/console): run(?Input $input = null, ?Output $output = null) uses the real argv when no arguments are given — so it can also be called from code with $console runCommand('make:model', ['User'], $output) for testing. 3. Writing your own command Extend Command, declare the properties, implement handle(): Helper APIs available inside handle() (all from the base Command): Input: argument(), option(), hasArgument(), hasOption() Output: write(), writeln(), info(), success(), warning(), error(), debug(), table($headers, $rows) Interactive: ask($question, $default), confirm($q, $default), choice($q, array $options, $default) The Input parser supports positional arguments ($this argument(0)), long options name=value / flag, and combined short options abc. 4. Location & namespace conventions Item Standard location Namespace Custom commands app/Console/Commands/ App\\Console\\Commands Scaffold generator — created automatically by make:command As with other components: PascalCase folders, no underscores (see folder structure and routing). 5. Code generation (make: ) From MakeCommand (aliases: generate, g): Global generator options: force (overwrite existing files), path= (custom output location). Details of each generated artefact are in app components. 5b. CRUD generator (make:crud) A single command produces a complete CRUD set (modern framework style, yet still CI3/native flavoured): Model + full resource Controller + migration (Loader::dbforge() modern stack) + 5 CI3 style views (index/create/edit/show/ form) in app/Views/<resource /. Full user guide documentation (field types, route map, workflow, validation/CSRF notes): generator crud. 5a. Creating a new project (new) & dev server (serve) Besides the code generators, the Console provides two project bootstrap commands: new (aliases create project, new:project) creates the standard folder structure, a PSR 4 App\\ composer.json, config, routes (legacy + modern), .env, and starter code. Options: force (non empty directory), min (no demo code). serve runs the PHP built in server with public/index.php as the router; options host= and port=. Complete guide (generated structure, config contents, quick flow): new project. 6. Migrating CLI usage from CI3 CI3 usually created a \"CLI only controller\" (class Cli extends CI Controller with an is cli() check). Conversion map: CI3 pattern Kodhe Console equivalent if (!is cli()) show 404(); not needed — Console::run() only executes from the CLI Controller methods as \"commands\" one Command class per task, explicit names (sync:data) Manual $argv[2] $this argum"}, {"url": "en/concepts/folder-structure-and-routing.html", "title": "Folder Structure & Router (Differences from CI3)", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Folder Structure & Router (Differences from CI3) ⚠️ Migration issue to be aware of. Kodhe Framework has its own folder naming conventions and routing system that differ from CodeIgniter 3 . This page honestly maps out the differences together with a coexistence/adapter strategy. For the application move procedure, see Migrating from CodeIgniter 3. 1. Folder structure comparison Area CodeIgniter 3 Kodhe (modern convention) Application root application/ (APPPATH) app/ — MakeCommand generates controllers into app/Controllers, models into app/Models, commands into app/Console/Commands (framework/src/Console/Commands/MakeCommand.php) Folder letter case all lowercase : controllers/, models/, core/ PascalCase with a leading capital : Controllers/, Models/, Console/ Underscores in names many: libraries/form validation.php, core/Security.php etc. no — PSR 4 classes & directories are PascalCase (FormValidation, ImageLib). Underscore style names are only used inside the legacy kernel (framework/src/Support/Legacy/...) Routing one file: application/config/routes.php (the $route array) two paths: CI3 style routes.php (legacy) plus modern routes APPPATH.'routes/web.php', routes/api.php, routes/console.php, and per module routes/web.php / routes/api.php Views application/views/ Kodhe\\Framework\\View\\Parser reads whatever path you give it — no mandatory folder; the modern convention puts them under app/Views Controller namespace global (class Welcome extends CI Controller) App\\Controllers\\... (PSR 4, needs a manual autoload mapping in composer.json because the kernel does not register the App\\ prefix automatically) Important consequence: on a case sensitive filesystem (Linux), controllers/ ≠ Controllers/ . Old CI3 applications are still read by the kernel as is (the loader and LegacyRouter use APPPATH.'controllers/' with ucfirst($class)), but new code/modules should follow the PascalCase convention so they match the modern router and the flexible Autoloader. 2. The flexible autoloader softens part of the problem Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Autoloader (kernel) is deliberately tolerant of the CI3 style. For every registered namespace prefix it tries the following patterns (tryLoadClass()): 1. The original PSR 4 path (PascalCase folder); 2. All parts lowercase (CI3 style); 3. Lowercase folders only; 4. The CI3 underscore style (Product Reviews → product reviews.php); 5. Controller variants with a Controller suffix (HomeController → Home.php); 6. A case insensitive search as a last resort (per segment scandir). So App\\Controllers\\ProductController can still load even if the old product folder is named controllers/product.php. The limitation: this tolerance belongs to the kernel autoloader — if you run purely per package without kodhe/framework, Composer's strict PSR 4 applies, so folder & class names must exactly match the namespace. 3. The Kodhe router: two engines in one class Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Routing\\Router (http/src/Routing/Router.php) extends LegacyRouter (a pure CI3 engine) and adds a modern layer. Its configuration: Request resolution flow: 1. Modern routes (matchRequest()): the URI is matched against the RouteCollection loaded from routes/web.php api.php console.php in APPPATH and in every module folder (Modules::folders()). Route caching is active in production — do not forget clearCache() after changing route files. 2. Explicit namespace in the URI : segments containing \\ are resolved through parseNamespaceSegments() — action separators ::, @, or /; e.g. App\\Controllers\\Home@index. 3. Legacy fallback (locate() → LegacyRouter): $route['uri'] from config/routes.php, then controller auto detection with the ucfirst() rules: module aware: /{module}/{controller}/{method} via Modules::locations; controllers/{Segment}.php, subfolders, folder same name patterns, down to lowercase filename attempts; the default controller is searched under the names Home, Index, Main, Welcome (DEFAULT CONTROLLER NAMES) — different from CI3 , which only knows a sin"}, {"url": "en/concepts/installation.html", "title": "Installation", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Installation Requirements PHP = 7.4 (8.1+ recommended; CI runs on 8.2) Composer 2 Extensions per package: gd/imagick (image), mysqli pdo (database), openssl (encrypt/encryption), zip (zip). Option A — Framework root (full stack application) Registers the PSR 4 autoload prefix Kodhe\\Framework\\ for ALL packages at once plus the framework/ kernel. Use this if your application uses many libraries. Option B — Per package (lean dependencies) Install only what you use. Package name = folder in the repo (see the library index). Note: a few older packages use different composer names — check the package's composer.json before installing (e.g. kodhe/parser, kodhe/encrypt). Installing from source (monorepo development) The framework/ kernel maps each package namespace to the monorepo root folder, so package changes take effect immediately without publishing. Quick verification"}, {"url": "en/concepts/migrating-from-ci3.html", "title": "Migrating from CodeIgniter 3 to Kodhe Framework", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Migrating from CodeIgniter 3 to Kodhe Framework This guide is the complete path for moving a CodeIgniter 3 application to Kodhe Framework . The big principle: Kodhe is not a new framework you have to learn from scratch — it is the CI3 libraries modernised into Composer packages under the Kodhe\\Framework\\ namespace, wrapped in a compatibility layer kernel so old CI3 code keeps running. You may migrate incrementally , module by module. Related reading: namespace map · architecture · installation · running the application · troubleshooting 0. Strategy: two paths, mixing allowed Path Best for How A. Compat layer (light big bang) Large CI3 apps, want to run again quickly on PHP 8 Install the framework/ kernel, run CI3 controllers/models as is; the $CI load library() loader keeps working + automatic CI aliases B. Pure packages (incremental) New code / gradual refactoring composer require kodhe/<package then use the PSR 4 classes directly (use Kodhe\\Framework\\...) without the loader Recommendation: start with A so the application comes back alive, then move modules one by one to B . Both can run side by side in one application (dual mode loader — see architecture). 1. Prerequisites & auditing the legacy code Audit first before touching composer: Make sure the original CI3 application already runs on PHP 8.1+ with strict error reporting — first fix the PHP 7 inherited deprecated warnings (undefined variables, strlen(null), etc.) before adding the migration layer. 2. Installation Details in installation. In short: The CI3 application folder structure (application/config, controllers, models, views, migrations) does not change — the kernel reads it as is. ⚠️ But note: Kodhe also has its own structure conventions for new code — PascalCase folders without underscores (app/Controllers/, app/Models/) and a dual router system (modern + legacy) whose behaviour differs from CI3. This is a real issue during incremental migration; the full mapping together with the coexistence strategy is in Folder Structure & Router , and the standard for writing each component (controller/model/library/view) with per file conversions is in Standard Application Components . 3. Bootstrapping the application Replace the bootstrap in index.php. CI3: Kodhe (kernel mode): Pure package mode needs no bootstrap at all — just require 'vendor/autoload.php' and instantiate the classes you need (see running.md § Pure package mode). Application requires the kodhe/http package; if it is not installed you will get a RuntimeException with the composer require kodhe/http instruction. 4. Configuration: CI3 arrays are accepted as is The kernel reads CI3 style configuration (config.php, database.php) and translates it into the service container (framework/src/Config/Setup.php). You do NOT need to rewrite the config files. What must be checked/changed: CI3 key Status in Kodhe base url, index page, uri protocol ✅ same sess driver, sess cookie name, sess expiration ✅ same; sess save path must be filled (table name for the database driver, folder for files) $db['default'] (hostname, username, …) ✅ same; mysqli/pdo drivers encryption key ⚠️ only relevant for the old encrypt package; the modern encryption package uses its own key — see encrypt.md 5. Namespace & loader map This is the heart of the migration. The full table of loader names → FQCNs → packages is in the namespace migration map . The general pattern: CI3 original Kodhe (new code) CI Session, $this load library('session') Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\Drivers\\ CI Form validation Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation (package kodhe/validation) CI Pagination Kodhe\\Framework\\Pagination\\Pagination CI Email Kodhe\\Framework\\Email\\Email CI Upload Kodhe\\Framework\\Upload\\Upload CI Image lib Kodhe\\Framework\\Image\\Image $this db … (query builder) Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\ Kodhe\\Session\\Session (legacy Kodhe) ❌ obsolete — always use the Kodhe\\Framework\\ prefix Rules of thumb: 1. Old $this load library('x') code keeps running via the compat"}, {"url": "en/concepts/namespaces-migration.html", "title": "Namespace Migration (CI3 → Kodhe Framework)", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Namespace Migration (CI3 → Kodhe Framework) This page is the name reference map . For the complete step by step migration procedure (installation, bootstrap, config, verification checklist, rollback), see Migrating from CodeIgniter 3. There are three namespace generations. Modern application code only needs to know the third one. Generation Example Status Original CI3 CI Session, $this load library('session') Still works via loader aliases Legacy Kodhe Kodhe\\Session\\Session, Kodhe\\Library\\ Obsolete — not autoloaded, never write it in new code Active (PSR 4) Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\DatabaseDriver etc. ✅ Standard across all packages Loader library name → active class map The old loader ($CI load library('<name ')) maps to: Loader name Active class Composer package user agent, agent Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\UserAgent kodhe/agent form validation Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation kodhe/validation pagination Kodhe\\Framework\\Pagination\\Pagination kodhe/pagination email Kodhe\\Framework\\Email\\Email kodhe/email session drivers in Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\Drivers\\ kodhe/session image lib Kodhe\\Framework\\Image\\Image (+Drivers\\GdDriver) kodhe/image upload Kodhe\\Framework\\Upload\\Upload kodhe/upload database Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\ kodhe/database table Kodhe\\Framework\\Table\\Table kodhe/table parser Kodhe\\Framework\\Parser\\ kodhe/parser encrypt / encryption Kodhe\\Framework\\Encrypt\\ / Encryption\\ kodhe/encrypt, kodhe/encryption ftp Kodhe\\Framework\\Ftp\\Ftp kodhe/ftp zip Kodhe\\Framework\\Zip\\Zip kodhe/zip calendar Kodhe\\Framework\\Calendar\\Calendar kodhe/calendar cart Kodhe\\Framework\\Cart\\Cart kodhe/cart typography Kodhe\\Framework\\Typography\\Typography kodhe/typography javascript Kodhe\\Framework\\Javascript\\Javascript kodhe/javascript migration Kodhe\\Framework\\Migration\\Migration kodhe/migration trackback Kodhe\\Framework\\Trackback\\Trackback kodhe/trackback xmlrpc / xmlrpcs Kodhe\\Framework\\Xmlrpc\\ / Xmlrpcs\\ kodhe/xmlrpc, kodhe/xmlrpcs profiler Kodhe\\Framework\\Profiler\\Profiler kodhe/profiler cache factory Kodhe\\Framework\\Cache\\ kodhe/cache Rules for writing new code 1. Always use Kodhe\\Framework\\<Package \\<Class ; — never write Kodhe\\Library\\ or Kodhe\\<Package \\<Class (without Framework). 2. Do not rely on CI aliases; they are only a safety net for legacy code. 3. If Class \"Kodhe\\<X \\<Y \" not found appears: the legacy class is not autoloaded — switch to the FQCN in the table above and run composer dump autoload. Small API changes during migration Some methods were normalised to camelCase, e.g. Email: reply to() → replyTo(), set mailtype() replaced by a config option; DB sessions use the new CI3 schema column (timestamp, not lastactivity — the gc fallback still supports the old one). Always check the package README for the final signature."}, {"url": "en/concepts/security.html", "title": "Security", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Security This page covers the security features currently supported by Kodhe Framework : XSS filtering, CSRF protection, input filtering, password hashing, data encryption, secure cookies & sessions, rate limiting, and input validation. Each section includes notes on migrating from CodeIgniter 3 where relevant. All APIs below have been verified against the package source code (framework/src/Support/Legacy/, http/src/, session/src/, encrypt/src/). 1. Quick summary Need Kodhe solution Status vs CI3 XSS cleaning Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Legacy\\Security::xss clean() + global helper xss clean() ✅ identical to CI3 CSRF csrf protection config keys etc., verified automatically by the legacy Input; for the modern router build your own middleware ⚠️ partial (see §3.4) Input filtering $this input post('x', true) (xss clean flag) ✅ identical to CI3 Password hashing PHP's built in password hash() / password verify() (+ compat polyfill) ✅ same Data encryption Package kodhe/encrypt — Kodhe\\Framework\\Encrypt\\Encrypt ✅ + migrate() method Secure cookies cookie secure, cookie httponly config; session cookie httponly=true by default ✅ same Rate limiting RateLimiter + ThrottleRequests middleware (modern router) 🆕 new, not available in CI3 Input validation FormValidation (CI3 compatible) or the modern kodhe/validation package ✅ two paths CAPTCHA create captcha() helper ✅ CI3 port 2. XSS Filtering 2.1 API The compatibility kernel provides a class that is a direct port of CI Security: Available methods: xss clean(), sanitize filename(), entity decode(), strip image tags(), get random bytes(), xss hash(). Global helpers (load with $this load helper('security')): 2.2 Global XSS filtering (CI3 behaviour) As in CI3, the legacy input applies per request XSS cleaning through the second flag: Recommendation : do not rely on global filtering. Store raw data, then escape on output (htmlentities() / the view engine). xss clean is a good fit for rich text input that will actually be rendered. 2.3 Migration from CI3 CI3 patterns keep working as is in the compatibility kernel: For new code, call the class directly (new Security(...)) or the global helpers — $this load library('security') is no longer needed. 3. CSRF Protection 3.1 Configuration (config.php — the CI3 format is accepted directly) 3.2 How it works (compatibility kernel) Verified in Legacy/Input.php: when Input is constructed and csrf protection is enabled, every POST request automatically goes through Security::csrf verify() — exactly like CI3. An invalid token produces a 403 error (\"The action you have requested is not allowed.\"). Inside forms, insert the token following the exact CI3 pattern: Excluded URIs are matched with preg match(' ^'.$excluded.'$ i') against uri string(). 3.3 AJAX For AJAX requests, send the token in a header and read its value as in CI3 — make sure csrf cookie name is readable by JS (if the token cookie needs to be non httpOnly), or include the hash in the initial JSON response. 3.4 Modern router (kodhe/http) ⚠️ Known issue : the modern router (Route:: / kodhe/http) has no built in CSRF middleware — CSRF verification only happens in the legacy Input pipeline. For a purely modern application: 1. Create your own middleware (e.g. App\\Middleware\\CsrfMiddleware) that instantiates Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Legacy\\Security and then calls csrf verify() on POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE requests. 2. Register its alias in app/Config/middleware.php (read by MiddlewareRegistry — keys aliases, groups, priority). 3. Attach it to a group/route: Route::group(...) middleware('csrf'). 3.5 Migration from CI3 No changes are required: the six config keys in §3.1 are read directly by the kernel, and $this security get csrf hash() remains available. The only thing that changes is if you move to fully modern routing — see §3.4. 4. Password Hashing Use the native PHP functions — available out of the box in PHP 8, and the package ships a compat polyfill (Support/Legacy/compat/password.php) for older environments"}, {"url": "en/concepts/services-modules-routing.html", "title": "Services, Modules, Modern Routing & Facades", "section": "en/concepts", "text": "Services, Modules, Modern Routing & Facades This page completes the documentation of the built in Kodhe Framework features (the framework/ kernel + the kodhe/http package) that are not covered elsewhere: the service container & service providers (addons), the module system, modern routing (Route::), middleware, and global facades. All APIs below are verified from the source code: framework/src/Container, framework/src/Foundation/Service, framework/src/Support/Modules.php, http/src/Routing, http/src/Middleware, framework/src/Support/Facades. For moving an existing application, see Migrating from CI3 and Folder Structure & Router. 1. Service Container (Kodhe\\Framework\\Container\\Container) The container is a dependency injection registry with prefixed naming . Every service is stored as a \"prefix:Name\" string; if no prefix is written, the container automatically uses the native kodhe: prefix (Container::NATIVE PREFIX). Implementation notes (as in the code): make() is called variadically: extra arguments are forwarded to the closure/factory. make() also accepts the form make($bindingObject, $name, ...$args) to resolve through a specific sub binding. Contract interface: BindingInterface (register, bind, registerSingleton, make); the ConcreteBinding decorator forwards to its delegate when a name is not found locally. Not found errors are thrown via Exceptions\\ContainerException::notFound($id, $availableServices) (the message includes the list of available services). 2. ServiceProvider / ServiceLocator / ServiceManager (Addon system) A set of classes in Kodhe\\Framework\\Foundation\\Service for packaging features as self contained addons/modules (an ExpressionEngine style inherited pattern): Class Role ServiceLocator Provider registry: register($prefix, $provider), has, get, all — duplicate prefix → Exception(\"Addon of name {$prefix} already registered.\") ServiceProvider Base class per addon; reads the array from the setup file, registers autoload namespaces, services, singletons, models, aliases ServiceManager Orchestration: scans the addon folder, addProvider(), collects data across providers (forward()) ServiceHelper Static service access with automatic prefix detection 2.1 Addon setup file An addon is a folder containing an addon.setup.php file that returns an array : Rules enforced by the code (ServiceProvider::registerServices): Service names must not contain : (it is used as the prefix separator). Services are registered under the \"{addon}:{Name}\" key in the container; the provider's register/registerSingleton/make methods always force the prefix through ensurePrefix() (the special name App is mapped to kodhe:App). A string value in services is wrapped with reflection: it instantiates the namespace\\Class class with the remaining arguments. Numeric keyed aliases trigger a mapping of Kodhe\\Modules... → the Modules... alias; for CI aliases the lowercase variant (CI model) is registered too, so it is safe on case sensitive Linux. 2.2 Runtime registration Prefix conflicts: an existing provider is never overwritten , unless the old path contains Addons/pro/levelups or ExpressionEngine/Addons (pro/first party priority — internal logic of addProvider()). 2.3 Accessing services: ServiceHelper & the service() helper Name conversion (methodToServiceName): underscores are stripped then ucwords is applied, and the Service suffix is appended when missing. Resolution uses kodhe('App') (the Application/provider root instance) — which means these helpers only work once the Kodhe kernel/bootstrap is running ; in pure per package mode, use Container::make() directly. 3. Module System (Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Modules) A module = a self contained application folder under APPPATH.'modules/' (other locations are possible via the modules locations config) with the CI3 HMVC style structure: controllers/ models/ views/ config/ (routes.php). 3.1 Lifecycle Modules::init() — call once during bootstrap: determines the locations, tries the cache, then runs sca"}, {"url": "en/general/crud-generator.html", "title": "CRUD Generator (make:crud)", "section": "en/general", "text": "CRUD Generator (make:crud) php console make:crud <ResourceName builds a complete CRUD set in a single command — like php artisan make: in modern frameworks. The generated output can follow the style you choose: Routing style : kodhe (modern router, Route::resource) and/or CI3 (legacy $route[...]) — via style. View engine : CI3 style native PHP ( .php) or Blade ( .blade.php) — via engine. Routes are registered automatically into the project's configuration files, so there is no more manual editing after generating. Good for: quickly porting one entity from a CI3 application, or building a new admin module (list → create → edit → show → delete) in a Kodhe project. 1. Syntax Part Description <ResourceName Required. UpperCamelCase , singular form: Post, Article, ProductTag field:type Optional, many allowed. List of table + model columns. Example: title:string body:text published:bool style=kodhe\\ ci3\\ both Which route style is registered automatically (default: both). kodhe → app/Config/routes modern.php, ci3 → app/Config/routes.php engine=php\\ blade View engine of the generated files (default: php). blade produces .blade.php resolved through the Kodhe ViewFactory force Overwrite existing files (default: the generator stops and writes nothing at all when there is a conflict) path= Custom output location (global make: option) Equivalent invocation aliases: php console g:crud Post, php console generate crud Post. Recognised field types Written as Becomes a column (migration Forge) Notes string (default) VARCHAR(255) Any mistyped name automatically falls back to string text TEXT integer / int INT(9) boolean / bool TINYINT(1) date / datetime / decimal as their names imply The id column (auto increment primary key) and created at/updated at (DATETIME) are added automatically — do not redeclare them. Without a field list, the generator uses the default example name:string. 2. Generated artefacts Example: php console make:crud Article title:string slug:string body:text published:bool File Contents app/Models/Article.php Model extending Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model (CI3 compatible ORM). $table = 'articles', $useTimestamps = true, and $allowedFields filled automatically from the field list (without id) so mass assignment insert()/update() is immediately safe to use app/Controllers/ArticleController.php Controller extending Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Controllers\\BaseController with full actions: index create store show edit update delete. The class name gets the Controller suffix so it does not clash with the identically named Model database/migrations/<timestamp create articles table.php Anonymous class migration with up()/down() using the modern database stack : Loader::dbforge(kodhe() db, true) + add field/add key/create table (not the legacy CI::load dbutil) app/Views/articles/index.php Listing table + Show/Edit/Delete buttons (.blade.php extension when engine=blade) app/Views/articles/create.php Add form (POSTs to the resource) app/Views/articles/edit.php Edit form (POSTs to update/{id}) app/Views/articles/show.php Detail of a single record app/Views/articles/ form.php Shared form fields — already filled automatically according to the field:type list you declared (<input /<textarea /<select per column, complete with old values for edit mode) app/Config/routes modern.php (with style=kodhe/both) Modern routes added automatically: Route::resource(...) + the POST update/{id} and DELETE {id} routes pointing at the generated controller methods app/Config/routes.php (with style=ci3/both) The CI3 style $route['articles/...'] map is added automatically (7 URI patterns: index/create/store/show/edit/update/delete) Automatic naming: table = plural snake case (ProductTag → product tags), URL segment = plural kebab case (/product tags). The pluralizer is still simple — double check table/URL names for irregular words (e.g. Category → categories is correct, but foreign technical terms may be wrong) and adjust them if needed. 3. Automatic routes ( style) "}, {"url": "en/general/new-project.html", "title": "Creating a New Project (php console new)", "section": "en/general", "text": "Creating a New Project (php console new) The new command in the Kodhe Console scaffolds a ready to run Kodhe Framework application skeleton: the standard folder structure (PascalCase, no ), a composer.json with the PSR 4 App\\ mapping, bootstrap files, configuration, an .env template, plus starter code (controller/model/view/routes) so that php console serve works immediately. This document covers the new and serve commands, which form the standard pair for starting a project locally. 1. Prerequisites Requirement Notes PHP = 8.1 Composer to install dependencies after scaffolding Kodhe Console available from the framework checkout (bin/console) or from the kodhe/framework package You do not need an existing project — new creates the target directory from scratch. 2. Basic command Recognised aliases: new:project, create project. Options Option Function force Scaffold into an existing, non empty directory (generated files will overwrite files with the same name) min Minimal skeleton: folders + config only, without demo code (Home controller, Base model, welcome view). Instead, .gitkeep files are created in the empty folders Examples: If the target directory already contains files and force is not given, the command stops with an error message and exit code 1. 3. Generated structure Important notes: The project name in composer.json is derived from the folder name (lowercase, illegal characters → ), the prefix stays app/<name . The project's console looks for vendor/autoload.php at the project root (falling back one level up), so it works after composer install. Folder conventions follow the Kodhe standard: PascalCase, no underscores (see folder structure and routing). 4. Built in configuration contents .env SESS SAVE PATH must point to a writable folder when using the file session driver — the default value storage/Session is already provided. app/Config/config.php Contains safe defaults for development: an empty index page (clean URLs), the modern router active side by side with the legacy router, and cache routes enabled only when ENVIRONMENT === 'production'. Routes routes.php — CI3 style: $route['default controller'] = 'Home/index'; served by the legacy router. routes modern.php — fluent style: Route::get('/', 'App\\Controllers\\Home@index'); The modern router is checked first when enable modern routing is active, so both files can coexist. Details: services modules routing. Starter code App\\Controllers\\Home extends BaseController with an index() method (rendering view('home/index', ...)) and hello(string $name) — enough to verify that routing, controllers, and views work before you write your own code. Component writing standard: app components. 5. Running the dev server (serve) Option Default Description host= localhost Interface/address binding (e.g. 0.0.0.0 to expose it on the network) port= 8080 TCP port; validated 1–65535, anything else errors Under the hood serve runs the PHP built in server with public/index.php as the router script, so every request goes through the front controller. Example: A composer script is also available: composer serve. 6. Quick flow from zero to the first page Continue developing with the code generators: Full list of scaffold commands: cli console. Step by step CRUD generator guide: generator crud. 7. Notes & limitations new does not run composer install automatically — dependencies are installed manually following the \"Next steps\" instructions printed by the command. Generated files are silently overwritten when they already exist (especially with force); commit/backup your target directory first. To migrate an existing CI3 project (not a new project), do not use new; follow the migrating from ci3 procedure — new is useful for preparing a pure Kodhe skeleton as a migration destination. See also: installation · running · troubleshooting"}, {"url": "en/general/running.html", "title": "Running the Application", "section": "en/general", "text": "Running the Application Minimum bootstrap (CI3 compat kernel mode) Application requires the kodhe/http package (Kernel, Request, Response). If it is not installed, the constructor fails with a clear message suggesting composer require kodhe/http. The kernel reads CI3 style configuration (base url, sess driver, $db['default'], …) and then registers services through the container (framework/src/Config/Setup.php). Access the container when you need to resolve things manually: $app getContainer() get('session'). Pure package mode (without the kernel) If you do not need the compat layer, use the packages directly like ordinary libraries: Development server For XAMPP/Laragon (/var/www/html/...): make sure the DocumentRoot points at the public/ folder (not the repo root), and that the default index.html does not shadow index.php. Checklist before deploying to dev 1. composer install no dev (or composer dump autoload o if vendor already exists). 2. Session configuration: sess driver + sess save path must NOT be empty — see troubleshooting. 3. The supporting database tables are created (sessions, ci migrations) per the package READMEs. 4. .env/config credentials are not committed to git."}, {"url": "en/general/troubleshooting.html", "title": "Troubleshooting", "section": "en/general", "text": "Troubleshooting A collection of the error messages that appear most often during development, together with their causes and solutions. All of them already have a fix in the framework — update your repository first (git pull + composer dump autoload). 1. Class \"Kodhe\\UserAgent\\UserAgent\" not found (or any other Kodhe\\<X \\<Y ) Cause : code/config uses the legacy namespace without the Framework prefix, which is not registered in the autoload. Solution : switch to the active FQCN — see the migration map. Example: Kodhe\\UserAgent\\UserAgent → Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\UserAgent. The $CI load library('user agent') loader has fixed its mapping since PR 194. 2. Unknown column 'data' in 'SELECT' (database sessions) Cause : the session table does not use the modern CI3 schema. Solution : create the table according to the session package README: then set $config['sess save path'] = 'ci sessions';. The driver now validates the schema and gives a clear message when columns are missing (PR 192). The old legacy lastactivity column is still supported for garbage collection. 3. Unable to inspect session table '' / strcspn(): Argument 1 ... null given Cause : sess save path is empty/null while sess driver = database. Solution : fill in the table name in the config (see 2). The framework now fails fast with an explicit message instead of a confusing TypeError (PR 192/ 196). For quick development, use 'sess driver' = 'files', 'sess save path' = sys get temp dir(). 4. \"Cannot resolve class ...\" errors inside packages Cause : usually the composer autoloader was not regenerated after switching folders/branches, or a bootstrap helper file is not loaded. Solution : run composer dump autoload then composer test; the actual per package results are recorded in issues 148– 175. 5. index.html shadows the application The repo/app root sometimes contains a default index.html; point the DocumentRoot at the public/ folder or delete that file."}, {"url": "en/libraries/agent.html", "title": "Agent", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Agent Package: kodhe/agent — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\ . Browser, platform, robot/mobile version detection in the style of the CodeIgniter 3 CI Agent class. Installation Quick Start Main API Method Description browser() / version() Browser name & version (with full fallbacks) platform() / platform version() The user's OS mobile() / is mobile() Mobile device name / boolean robot() / is robot() / robot referrer() Crawler identification user agent() / referrer() / accept language() Raw header values is browser($name) / is platform($name) Specific matching Migration notes from CI3 $this load library('agent') → instantiate new UserAgent($ SERVER) (or resolve it through the kernel service container when available). All CI3 methods are kept under the same names; return values are unchanged. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/auth.html", "title": "Auth", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Auth Package: kodhe/auth — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Auth\\ . Session based authentication + secure \"remember me\". The guard never touches the database directly: user lookup is delegated to your application's implementation of UserProviderInterface. Installation Quick Start Three usage styles: the Auth object, the static Facade, or the auth() helper. Main features Session based login/logout, storage re validation on every request (anti stale role) Remember me random tokens; only the SHA 256 hash is stored, with automatic rotation Login throttling (max attempts / lockout seconds) + timing equalized Registration (RegisterableProviderInterface), change & reset password (UpdatableProviderInterface, single use expiring tokens) Email verification (requestVerification / verifyEmail / isVerified) auth.login, auth.failed, auth.password reset, … events via an optional dispatcher Guard method Description attempt() / login() / logout() / check() Basic login flow user() / id($key) / setUser() Active user data (the password hash is always stripped) register() / changePassword() Account management sendPasswordReset() / resetPassword() Password reset requestVerification() / verifyEmail() / isVerified() Email verification Migration notes from CI3 CI3 has no built in auth — this package replaces the common \"Ion auth / custom session\" patterns, with an extra hook on attempt() for additional conditions (e.g. ['is active' = 1]). Full API details: package README · See also session · Socialite"}, {"url": "en/libraries/cache.html", "title": "Cache", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Cache Package: kodhe/cache — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Cache\\ . Multi driver cache storage (file, apc, redis, memcached, wincache, dev null) with a uniform API, replacing CI Cache. Installation Quick Start Main API Method Description get($key) / save($key, $value, $ttl) / delete($key) Basic operations increment() / decrement() Counters clean() / invalidate() Purge by pattern / everything isAvailable() Check driver status Configuration for the other drivers (redis/memcached: host, port, auth) is fully documented in the README. Migration notes from CI3 $this load driver('cache') → new Cache($config) directly. CI3 method names (get, save, delete) are still recognized; unavailable built in CI3 drivers automatically fall back to backup. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/calendar.html", "title": "Calendar", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Calendar Package: kodhe/calendar — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Calendar\\ . Generates monthly/weekly/daily HTML calendars with customizable templates, equivalent to CI Calendar. Installation Quick Start Modes & customization show() / month view by default; week view($day) and year view() are available. Full templates via set template() (array of parts: table open, heading row, day cell, etc.) — the keys are the same as CI3. get month name(), get day names() help with custom rendering. Migration notes from CI3 The old methods (generate, show, week view, year view, set date, set template) are kept; only the way the object is loaded changes. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/cart.html", "title": "Cart", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Cart Package: kodhe/cart — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Cart\\ . Session based shopping cart in the style of CodeIgniter 3's Libraries/Cart. Installation Quick Start Main API Method Description insert($items) / update($items) / remove($rowid) Manage items contents($newest first) Item list (array) total() / quantity() / subtotal() / tax() / shipping cost() Price summaries destroy() Empty the cart Migration notes from CI3 The item array structure and configuration keys (cart product id, tax, shipping, etc.) are identical to CI3 — only the way the object is loaded changes. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/database.html", "title": "Database", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Database Package: kodhe/database (+ kodhe/driver as the driver abstraction). Connection Query Builder (CI3 style) The Mysqli driver validates identifiers safely (the null guard has been fixed — there is no longer a strcspn() TypeError on empty input). Migration Use the separate kodhe/migration package — see migration.md. Full config schema details & transactions: package README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/driver.html", "title": "Driver System", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Driver System Package: kodhe/driver — a PSR 4 compatible modular driver system for CodeIgniter 3, the foundation of the CI Cache/CI Session style \"driver + parent library\" pattern. Installation Concepts Class Role Contracts\\DriverInterface Contract for each driver Contracts\\DriverLibraryInterface Contract for the parent library AbstractDriver Driver base class (config, etc.) DriverLibrary Parent library base class (selects & uses a driver) NullDriver Null object fallback when a driver fails to load Resolvers\\DriverFileResolver Resolve & load driver files Registry\\DriverInstanceRegistry Driver instance cache (registry pattern) Quick Start This pattern is exactly how $this load driver('cache') works in CI3 — use it when writing a new library that needs swappable backends (queue, storage, payment gateway). Full API details: package README"}, {"url": "en/libraries/email.html", "title": "Email", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Email Package: kodhe/email — Kodhe\\Framework\\Email\\Email (mail/smtp/sendmail). Changes vs CI3: fluent chaining, reply to() → replyTo(), debug output via printDebugger(). Details: package README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/encrypt.html", "title": "Encryption", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Encryption Two different packages — do not mix them up: Package Class Purpose kodhe/encrypt Kodhe\\Framework\\Encrypt\\Encrypt Legacy CI3 encryption (mcrypt era, existing data compatibility) kodhe/encryption Kodhe\\Framework\\Encryption\\ Modern OpenSSL based encryption — for new data Rule of thumb: decrypt legacy data with encrypt, migrate it, then store it again with encryption. Details: each package's README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/ftp.html", "title": "FTP", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "FTP Package: kodhe/ftp — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Ftp\\ . Klien FTP/FTPS: login, upload/download, manajemen direktori, setara CI Ftp. Installation Quick Start Supported operations login(), put()/upload(), get()/download(), cd(), pwd(), mkdir()/createdir(), rmdir()/deletedir(), rename(), delete file(), chmod file(), list file()/list contents(), debug(). SSL connections go through FtpSslConnection. Migration notes from CI3 The old method API is preserved; configuration can be passed via the constructor instead of $this load library('ftp', $config). Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/http.html", "title": "HTTP (Request / Response / Middleware)", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "HTTP (Request / Response / Middleware) Package: kodhe/http. Middleware callable: implementasi MiddlewareInterface menerima $next; rantai dieksekusi bergaya onion. Dokumentasi penuh header, cookies, file upload request, and the built in middleware list: package README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/image.html", "title": "Image", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Image Package: kodhe/image — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Image\\ . Manipulasi gambar (resize, crop, rotate, watermark) berbasis driver GD, setara CI Image lib. Installation Requirements: PHP = 8.1 with the gd extension. Quick Start Supported operations resize (maintain ratio), crop, rotate, flip/flop, grayscale, brightness, contrast, sharpening, and watermarking (full wm support like CI3). Migration notes from CI3 $this load image($config) → new Image($config); the legacy wm config keys are still accepted as is. Other drivers (imagick) can be added through the kodhe/driver package's driver system; GdDriver ships by default. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/index.html", "title": "Library Reference (per Package)", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Library Reference (per Package) Every page follows the same format as the CI3 user guide: introduction → installation → usage → method reference → migration notes. Final API details always live in each package's README (source of truth); this page is the learning path. Category Package Page Core Components loader (kernel) loader kernel.md Web Services http (request/response/middleware) http.md Web Services view (template engine) view.md Database queries/builders database.md Database migrations migration.md General Topics session session.md General Topics auth auth.md General Topics socialite socialite.md General Topics email email.md General Topics encrypt/encryption encrypt.md General Topics cache cache.md General Topics driver (driver system) driver.md Help & Validation form validation validation.md Help & Validation pagination pagination.md Utilities (overview) all utility packages utilities.md Utilities agent agent.md Utilities calendar calendar.md Utilities cart cart.md Utilities image image.md Utilities javascript javascript.md Utilities parser parser.md Utilities profiler profiler.md Utilities table table.md Utilities typography typography.md Utilities upload upload.md Utilities ftp ftp.md Utilities zip zip.md Third Party / RPC xmlrpc, xmlrpcs, trackback rpc trackback.md Testing unit test (via kernel test) testing.md Need a package whose page does not exist yet? Open an issue — documentation contributions follow the existing page template."}, {"url": "en/libraries/javascript.html", "title": "Javascript", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Javascript Package: kodhe/javascript — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Javascript\\ . Helper jQuery/Prototype/JQueryLib scripts à la CI Javascript — mainly for validasi form sisi klien. Installation Quick Start Migration notes from CI3 The old API (validation() and the other helpers) is preserved. For new projects, consider the browser's built in Constraint Validation or your frontend library — this package is available primarily for legacy CI3 application compatibility. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/loader-kernel.html", "title": "Loader & Kernel (Core Components)", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Loader & Kernel (Core Components) The framework/ kernel provides a CI3 style loading experience on top of the modern packages. load library() / model() / helper() The name→class mapping lives in FileLoader::packageMap() (single source of truth). When you add a new package, register it there so the legacy loader recognizes it. Service Container & Setup Config/Setup.php builds the services configuration array from the application config and registers a factory per service with the Container. Accessors: Dual mode The entire framework runs with OR without the kernel: importing package classes directly (pure PSR 4) is always allowed and recommended for new code."}, {"url": "en/libraries/migration.html", "title": "Migration", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Migration Package: kodhe/migration — Kodhe\\Framework\\Migration\\Migration. Migration files = a Migration <timestamp class with up()/down() methods. Configure the tracking table via the constructor (the CI superobject is no longer needed). Complete details: package README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/pagination.html", "title": "Pagination Library", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Pagination Library Package: kodhe/pagination — main class Kodhe\\Framework\\Pagination\\Pagination. Quick Start Core API Method Description initialize(array object $params) (re)configures the instance create links(): string Render the page links HTML cur page(): int Current active page total pages(): int Total number of pages The renderer can be adjusted via the query string segment, page query string, etc. config options. Full details & theme examples: package README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/parser.html", "title": "Parser", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Parser Package: kodhe/parser — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Parser\\ . Template engine simple tags à la CI Parser: {name}, pair tags {entries} … {/entries}, and the {else} conditional. Installation Quick Start Other methods: parse string($template, $data) (render a string, not a file) and associate() to populate tags from database query results like CI3. Migration notes from CI3 $this load parser parse(...) → instantiate Parser with the templatePath option. The old template syntax ({var}, pair tags, {else}, conditionals) stays the same. Need a modern engine (Blade/Twig) behind one API? See the view package. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/profiler.html", "title": "Profiler", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Profiler Package: kodhe/profiler — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Profiler\\ . Debug panel appended at the end of the page: benchmarks, database queries, memory, URI, GET/POST, config, session, and headers — the successor to CodeIgniter 3's $config['enable profiler']. Installation Quick Start Section selection & renderer The architecture is modularized into per section collectors (Collectors\\BenchmarkCollector, DatabaseCollector, etc.) and renderers (Renderers\\HtmlRenderer / TextRenderer) — a custom collector only needs a newly registered class. Migration notes from CI3 CI3 enabled the profiler through global configuration; in Kodhe you call run() explicitly so it can be restricted per environment (e.g. only when ENVIRONMENT === 'development'). Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/rpc-trackback.html", "title": "XML-RPC & Trackback", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "XML RPC & Trackback xmlrpc (client) — kodhe/xmlrpc xmlrpcs (server) — kodhe/xmlrpcs Register methods in application/config/xmlrpc.php like CI3; the Server class parses the request and calls IXR typed handlers. trackback — kodhe/trackback Validate & send/receive trackback pings; automatic integration when posting (if used). Details: xmlrpc/README.md, xmlrpcs/README.md, trackback/README.md."}, {"url": "en/libraries/session.html", "title": "Session", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Session Package: kodhe/session — drivers in Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\Drivers\\ (files, database; cookie/redis available via kernel configuration). Configuration (CI3 style) Usage Table schema (database driver) See troubleshooting §2 for the full DDL. The driver validates columns on read() and gives a clear error message when the schema does not match; gc() automatically supports the legacy lastactivity column. API details & options: package README."}, {"url": "en/libraries/socialite.html", "title": "Socialite", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Socialite Package: kodhe/socialite — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Socialite\\ . Native social OAuth login: the OAuth 1.0a & 2.0 protocols are implemented from scratch (not laravel/socialite, not Guzzle, not league/oauth2 client). Installation PHP = 8.1; ext curl recommended (automatic fallback to PHP streams). Built in providers Provider Protocol Google OAuth 2 / OIDC GitHub OAuth 2 Facebook OAuth 2 (Graph v18) GitLab OAuth 2 (self hosted supported) LinkedIn OAuth 2 / OIDC Twitter OAuth 1.0a (signing HMAC SHA1) Other providers can be registered via Manager::extend(). Quick Start Notes After obtaining $user, the application is still responsible for find or create of a local account and then calling Auth::login(). Full API details: package README · See also auth"}, {"url": "en/libraries/table.html", "title": "Table", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Table Package: kodhe/table — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Table\\ . Generates an HTML table from arrays or query results, equivalent to CI Table. Installation Quick Start Main API Method Description set heading() / set columns() Heading & column names add row() / insert row() / clear() Table rows set template() Custom HTML template (same keys as CI3) set caption() / set empty() Caption & empty cell content generate($data = null) Render the HTML table Migration notes from CI3 The API is identical to CI Table; only the way the object is loaded changes ($this load library('table') → new Table()). Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/testing.html", "title": "Testing", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Testing The framework uses PHPUnit (see the root phpunit.xml). For application unit tests: Testing principle for these packages: almost every class can be new ed directly with a config array (no CI superobject) — explicit dependency injection makes testing far easier than in CI3. PHPUnit is this project's only official tester (static analyzers such as PHPStan were removed to avoid duplication)."}, {"url": "en/libraries/typography.html", "title": "Typography", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Typography Package: kodhe/typography — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Typography\\ . Automatic text typography, the replacement for CI Typography. Installation Quick Start Migration notes from CI3 Method names and behavior are preserved following CI Typography; there are no configuration changes. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/upload.html", "title": "Upload", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Upload Package: kodhe/upload — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Upload\\ . Validation and moving of uploaded files, the replacement for manual $ FILES handling à la CI Upload. Installation Quick Start Main API Method / property Description initialize($config) Re sets the configuration do upload($field) Processes the upload of one field data() Array of uploaded file information display errors() / errors() Error messages as string / array set filename() etc. Same as CI3 (set allowed types, etc.) The full configuration (strict mime check, dimension limits, chmod, aliases) is in the package README. Migration notes from CI3 The API is intentionally kept identical — just replace library loading with class instantiation; there are no method name changes. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "en/libraries/utilities.html", "title": "Utilities (Supporting Packages)", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Utilities (Supporting Packages) A concise page; each row links to the package's canonical README. Package Main class Quick note agent Agent\\UserAgent Browser/platform/mobile/robot detection; $CI agent browser() image Image\\Image + Drivers\\GdDriver resize/crop/rotate/watermark via GD upload Upload\\Upload Upload file validation & moving ftp Ftp\\Ftp FTP client (login, put/get, dir listing) zip Zip\\Zip Create/extract ZIP archives table Table\\Table Generate an HTML table from arrays/query results parser Parser\\ CI3 parser style {name} pair tag templates calendar Calendar\\Calendar Monthly/weekly/daily HTML calendars javascript Javascript\\Javascript Prototype/jQuery/JQueryLib JS helpers typography Typography\\Typography autoyp, smart quotes, nl2br br profiler Profiler\\Profiler Time/memory/query debugging sections & collectors cache Factory cache File/apc/redis/memcached/wincache dev null cart Cart\\Cart Session based shopping cart Common examples (pick one to get started):"}, {"url": "en/libraries/validation.html", "title": "Form Validation Library", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Form Validation Library Package: kodhe/validation — main class Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation. The CI3 CI Form validation counterpart, with an identical rules string API. Installation Usage (CI3 pattern) Popular Built in Rules required, matches, valid email, valid url, integer, numeric, min length[n], max length[n], exact length[n], alpha, alpha numeric, in list[a,b,c], is unique[table.field], callback method name, etc. Full list + custom rules: see the package README. Migration Notes In CI3 controllers, $this form validation remains available via the kernel loader — no legacy code changes required. set value() has complete type docblocks (@return string array) so it is safe for IDEs and static analysis."}, {"url": "en/libraries/view.html", "title": "View", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "View Package: kodhe/view — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\View\\ . Multi engine template system ( PHP native , Blade via eftec/bladeone, Twig ) with layouts, themes, variants, and asset management — the successor to the view part of CI Load. Installation Requirements: PHP = 8.1. Optional: twig/twig if using the Twig engine. Quick Start Features: layouts & sections (extends/section), themes & variants (mobile/desktop), AssetManager for CSS/JS (inline, minify, grouping). Migration notes from CI3 $this load view('page', $data) → $view render('page', $data); legacy .php view files are still rendered without changes. CI3 third party parsers can be replaced by one of the built in engines. Full API details: package README · See also parser"}, {"url": "en/libraries/zip.html", "title": "Zip", "section": "en/libraries", "text": "Zip Package: kodhe/zip — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Zip\\ . Creates and reads ZIP archives without extra extensions, the replacement for CI Zip. Installation Quick Start Migration notes from CI3 $this load library('zip') → new Zip(). Modern method naming (addFile, addDir, archive, download) — the CI3 equivalents (read file, add data, zip file) are documented in the README. Full API details: package README · See also utilities"}, {"url": "id/concepts/app-components.html", "title": "Komponen Aplikasi Standar Kodhe (Controller, Model, Library, View/Template)", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Komponen Aplikasi Standar Kodhe (Controller, Model, Library, View/Template) Halaman ini adalah standar penulisan komponen aplikasi di Kodhe Framework — folder, namespace, dan kelas dasar yang benar — beserta cara memigrasikan tiap komponen dari CodeIgniter 3 . Untuk strategi migrasi menyeluruh lihat migrating from ci3; untuk perbedaan struktur folder & router lihat folder structure and routing. Ringkasan Cepat Komponen Standar Kodhe Support Legacy CI3 Scaffold CLI Controller app/Controllers/ .php, namespace App\\Controllers, extend Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Controllers\\BaseController $this load tetap tersedia via Controller + LegacyLoader make:controller Model app/Models/ .php, namespace App\\Models, extend Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model Extend CI Model lama jalan apa adanya make:model Library Instansiasi langsung new Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\<Class () atau container $this load library('x') dipetakan otomatis oleh LegacyLoader — View/Template Helper global view() → Kodhe\\Framework\\View\\ViewFactory (PHP/Blade/Twig, layout, theme) $this load view() tetap jalan; folder view lama dapat dipakai ulang — Semua nama folder Kodhe memakai huruf kapital di awal dan tanpa underscore (Controllers, Models, Middleware) — autoloader kernel toleran terhadap perbedaan case, tetapi mode paket murni PSR 4 menuntut kepatuhan penuh. 1. Controller Standar Kodhe Fakta dari kode (http/src/Controllers/): Controller (base) menyiapkan Facade aplikasi, menyimpan referensi controller lama ( legacy controller), dan memanggil load initialize() sehingga $this load (model/view/library/helper gaya CI3) tetap berfungsi di dalam controller modern . BaseController menambahkan beban otomatis yang opsional (helper string, library user agent, registrasi theme bila paket kodhe/view terpasang). Setiap kegagalan bersifat fail soft (paket boleh tidak terpasang). Tersedia juga RESTController sebagai base untuk API. Migrasi dari CI3 CI3: Langkah konversi: 1. Pindahkan file ke app/Controllers/ dengan nama file PascalCase sesuai class (Welcome.php berisi class Welcome). 2. Tambahkan namespace App\\Controllers; dan use Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Controllers\\BaseController;, ganti extends CI Controller → extends BaseController. 3. Nama method publik tetap sama — router legacy maupun modern akan menemukannya. Router modern default mencari Home/Index/Main/Welcome sebagai controller halaman depan. 4. $this load model()/view()/library()/helper() tidak wajib diubah pada tahap pertama (dimediasi LegacyLoader). Konsolidasi bertahap: model → instansiasi App\\Models\\... langsung / DI, view → helper view(), library → new Kodhe\\Framework\\... (lihat §3). 5. Daftarkan rute lama ke controller baru bila memakai router modern: ⚠️ Jangan campur dua namespace controller dalam satu file, dan hindari underscore pada nama class (item model → ItemModel) agar patuh PSR 4. 2. Model Standar Kodhe Model modern ada di paket kodhe/database: Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model (mewarisi ORM\\LegacyModel) dengan properti deklaratif dan query chainable. API utama (verifikasi dari database/src/Model.php): Query builder: select() where() orWhere() whereIn() like() orderBy() limit() groupBy() having() join() leftJoin() rightJoin() inRandomOrder() Relasi eager: with(['category']) Eksekusi: all() findAll($limit,$offset) first() find($id) findOrFail($id) count() sum() avg() max() min() chunk($size, fn) Write: insert($data, $returnId) insertBatch() update($data, $where) updateBatch() delete($id) restore() forceDelete() truncate() Upsert: firstOrCreate() firstOrNew() updateOrCreate() Tabel bisa diganti runtime: $model table('items archive') Contoh pemakaian di controller: Migrasi dari CI3 CI3: Peta konversi: CI3 Kodhe class Item model extends CI Model (file item model.php) class ItemModel extends Model (file app/Models/ItemModel.php) $this db get('items') result() $this findAll() / ItemModel::all() $this db where(...) get(...) row() $this where(...) first() $this db get where('items', ['id'= $id]) row() $this find($id) $this db insert('"}, {"url": "id/concepts/architecture.html", "title": "Arsitektur", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Arsitektur Kodhe Framework adalah hasil modulisasi library CodeIgniter 3 menjadi paket paket Composer independen ber namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\ (PSR 4), dibungkus kernel compatibility layer (framework/) agar aplikasi CI3 lama tetap berjalan. Lapisan Loader Dual Mode FileLoader mendukung dua gaya pemuatan: 1. Legacy CI3 : $CI load library('user agent') — nama lowercase, di resolve lewat packageMap internal ke FQCN modern (Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\UserAgent), lalu alias kelas CI dibuat otomatis agar kode lama tidak berubah. 2. Modern PSR 4 : use Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation; langsung — disarankan untuk kode baru; tidak bergantung pada loader sama sekali. Service Container framework/src/Config/Setup.php mendaftarkan factory per layanan (session, cache, database, dst.) yang membaca array konfigurasi ala CI3 ($config['sess driver'], $db['default'], …) dan mengembalikan instance paket modern. Ini jalur bootstrap yang dipakai saat aplikasi boot. Prinsip Paket Tidak ada dependensi antar paket wajib kecuali benar benar perlu (mis. http → pagination untuk PaginationFactoryInterface). Setiap paket standalone installable: composer require kodhe/<paket . README paket = sumber kebenaran API; user guide/ = narasi pembelajaran."}, {"url": "id/concepts/cli-console.html", "title": "CLI Console (Barisan Perintah)", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "CLI Console (Barisan Perintah) Kodhe Framework punya komponen Console bawaan (framework/src/Console/, namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Console\\) untuk menjalankan tugas development dan maintenance dari command line: code generation, migrasi, clear cache, jobs, dan command bisnis custom Anda sendiri. Ini adalah console kernel modern (gaya Symfony/Laravel), berbeda dari $this cli CI3 yang terikat pada URI segment. Aplikasi CI3 lama yang memakai CI Controller untuk CLI tetap jalan via kernel kompatibel — lihat §6 untuk cara memigrasikannya. 1. Arsitektur Singkat Kelas Peran Console Manager aplikasi CLI — singleton (Console::getInstance()), registry command, eksekusi run() Command Base class abstrak untuk semua command; subclass wajib mengimplementasi handle(): int Input Parser token argv → argumen posisional/nama + opsi ( foo=bar, f) Output Writer berwarna: writeln/info/success/warning/error/debug/table Commands\\HelpCommand help [command] — bantuan umum atau per command Commands\\ListCommand list — daftar semua command terdaftar Commands\\VersionCommand version — versi aplikasi console Commands\\MakeCommand make: — generator boilerplate (lihat §5) Empat command di atas otomatis terdaftar saat Console dibuat (registerDefaultCommands()). Command custom ditambahkan via addCommand() / addCommands(). 2. Menjalankan Console Buat bootstrap sekali jalan di proyek Anda (mis. bin/console): run(?Input $input = null, ?Output $output = null) memakai argv asli bila tidak diberi argumen — sehingga juga bisa dipanggil dari kode dengan $console runCommand('make:model', ['User'], $output) untuk pengujian. 3. Membuat Command Sendiri Extend Command, deklarasikan properti, implementasi handle(): API helper yang tersedia di dalam handle() (semua dari base Command): Input: argument(), option(), hasArgument(), hasOption() Output: write(), writeln(), info(), success(), warning(), error(), debug(), table($headers, $rows) Interaktif: ask($pertanyaan, $default), confirm($q, $default), choice($q, array $opsi, $default) Parse Input mendukung argumen posisional ($this argument(0)), opsi panjang nama=value / flag, dan opsi pendek gabungan abc. 4. Konvensi Lokasi & Namespace Item Lokasi standar Namespace Command custom app/Console/Commands/ App\\Console\\Commands Generator scaffold — dibuat otomatis oleh make:command Sama seperti komponen lain: folder PascalCase, tanpa underscore (lihat struktur folder routing). 5. Code Generation (make: ) Dari MakeCommand (alias: generate, g): Opsi global generator: force (timpa file yang ada), path= (lokasi output custom). Detail tiap artefak hasil generate ada di app components. 5b. Generator CRUD (make:crud) Satu perintah menghasilkan satu set lengkap CRUD (ala framework modern, tetap bergaya CI3/native): Model + Controller resource penuh + migration (Loader::dbforge() stack modern) + 5 view CI3 style (index/create/edit/show/ form) di app/Views/<resource /. Panduan user guide lengkap (tipe field, peta route, alur kerja, catatan validasi/CSRF): generator crud. 5a. Membuat Proyek Baru (new) & Dev Server (serve) Selain generator kode, Console menyediakan dua perintah bootstrap proyek: new (alias create project, new:project) membuat struktur folder standar, composer.json PSR 4 App\\, config, routes (legacy + modern), .env, dan kode starter. Opsi: force (direktori tidak kosong), min (tanpa demo). serve menjalankan PHP built in server dengan public/index.php sebagai router; opsi host= dan port=. Panduan lengkap (struktur hasil generate, isi config, alur cepat): membuat proyek baru. 6. Migrasi CLI dari CI3 CI3 biasanya membuat \"controller khusus CLI\" (class Cli extends CI Controller dengan cek is cli()). Peta konversinya: Pola CI3 Padanan Kodhe Console if (!is cli()) show 404(); tidak perlu — Console::run() hanya dieksekusi dari CLI Method controller sebagai \"command\" satu kelas Command per tugas, nama eksplisit (sync:data) $argv[2] manual $this argument(...) / $this option(...) echo / PHP EOL $this writeln()/success()/error()/table() Exit via "}, {"url": "id/concepts/folder-structure-and-routing.html", "title": "Struktur Folder & Router (Perbedaan dari CI3)", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Struktur Folder & Router (Perbedaan dari CI3) ⚠️ Isu migrasi yang perlu diketahui. Kodhe Framework punya konvensi penamaan folder dan sistem routing sendiri yang berbeda dari CodeIgniter 3 . Halaman ini memetakan perbedaannya secara jujur beserta strategi koeksistensi/adapter. Terkait prosedur pemindahan aplikasi, lihat Migrasi dari CodeIgniter 3. 1. Perbandingan struktur folder Area CodeIgniter 3 Kodhe (konvensi modern) Root aplikasi application/ (APPPATH) app/ — MakeCommand menghasilkan controller ke app/Controllers, model ke app/Models, command ke app/Console/Commands (framework/src/Console/Commands/MakeCommand.php) Huruf folder semua lowercase : controllers/, models/, core/ PascalCase huruf besar di awal : Controllers/, Models/, Console/ Underscore pada nama banyak: libraries/form validation.php, core/Security.php dst. tanpa — kelas & direktori PSR 4 PascalCase (FormValidation, ImageLib). Nama bergaya underscore hanya dipakai internal kernel legacy (framework/src/Support/Legacy/...) Routing satu file: application/config/routes.php (array $route) dua jalur: routes.php gaya CI3 (legacy) plus route modern APPPATH.'routes/web.php', routes/api.php, routes/console.php, dan routes/web.php / routes/api.php per modul Views application/views/ Kodhe\\Framework\\View\\Parser membaca path yang Anda berikan — tidak ada folder wajib; konvensi modern menaruhnya di bawah app/Views Namespace controller global (class Welcome extends CI Controller) App\\Controllers\\... (PSR 4, butuh autoload mapping manual di composer.json karena kernel tidak mendaftarkan prefix App\\ secara otomatis) Konsekuensi penting: di filesystem case sensitive (Linux), controllers/ ≠ Controllers/ . Aplikasi CI3 lama tetap dibaca kernel apa adanya (loader dan LegacyRouter memakai APPPATH.'controllers/' dengan ucfirst($class)), tetapi kode/modul baru sebaiknya mengikuti konvensi PascalCase agar cocok dengan router modern dan Autoloader fleksibel. 2. Autoloader fleksibel meredam sebagian masalah Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Autoloader (kernel) sengaja dibuat toleran terhadap gaya CI3. Untuk setiap prefix namespace yang terdaftar, ia mencoba pola (tryLoadClass()): 1. Path PSR 4 asli (folder PascalCase); 2. Semua bagian lowercase (gaya CI3); 3. Folder lowercase saja; 4. Gaya underscore CI3 (Product Reviews → product reviews.php); 5. Variasi controller berakhiran Controller (HomeController → Home.php); 6. Pencarian case insensitive sebagai upaya terakhir (scandir per segmen). Jadi App\\Controllers\\ProductController bisa tetap ter load walau foldernya produk lama bernama controllers/product.php. Batasannya: toleransi ini milik autoloader kernel — bila Anda berjalan murni per paket tanpa kodhe/framework, yang berlaku adalah PSR 4 kaku Composer, sehingga nama folder & kelas harus persis sesuai namespace. 3. Router Kodhe: dua mesin dalam satu kelas Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Routing\\Router (http/src/Routing/Router.php) mewarisi LegacyRouter (mesin CI3 murni) dan menambah lapisan modern. Konfigurasinya: Alur resolusi request: 1. Route modern (matchRequest()): URI dicocokkan terhadap RouteCollection yang dimuat dari routes/web.php api.php console.php di APPPATH dan di setiap folder modul (Modules::folders()). Cache rute aktif di production — jangan lupa clearCache() setelah mengubah file route. 2. Namespace eksplisit di URI : segmen yang mengandung \\ di resolve lewat parseNamespaceSegments() — separator aksi ::, @, atau /; mis. App\\Controllers\\Home@index. 3. Fallback legacy (locate() → LegacyRouter): $route['uri'] dari config/routes.php, lalu auto detect controller dengan aturan ucfirst(): module aware: /{module}/{controller}/{method} via Modules::locations; controllers/{Segment}.php, subfolder, pola folder same name, sampai percobaan filename lowercase; default controller dicari pada nama Home, Index, Main, Welcome (DEFAULT CONTROLLER NAMES) — berbeda dari CI3 yang hanya mengenal satu default controller dari config; translate uri dashes menggantikan → pada 3 segmen pertama. Perbedaan perilaku yan"}, {"url": "id/concepts/installation.html", "title": "Instalasi", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Instalasi Persyaratan PHP = 7.4 (disarankan 8.1+; CI dijalankan pada 8.2) Composer 2 Ekstensi sesuai paket: gd/imagick (image), mysqli pdo (database), openssl (encrypt/encryption), zip (zip). Opsi A — Root framework (aplikasi full stack) Mendaftarkan autoload PSR 4 prefix Kodhe\\Framework\\ untuk SEMUA paket sekaligus plus kernel framework/. Gunakan ini bila aplikasi memakai banyak library. Opsi B — Per paket (hemat dependensi) Hanya pasang yang dipakai. Nama paket = folder di repo (lihat indeks libraries). Catatan: sebagian kecil paket lama memakai nama composer berbeda — cek composer.json paket sebelum install (mis. kodhe/parser, kodhe/encrypt). Instalasi dari source (monorepo dev) Kernel framework/ memetakan namespace tiap paket ke folder root monorepo, sehingga perubahan paket langsung terasa tanpa publish. Verifikasi cepat"}, {"url": "id/concepts/migrating-from-ci3.html", "title": "Migrasi dari CodeIgniter 3 ke Kodhe Framework", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Migrasi dari CodeIgniter 3 ke Kodhe Framework Panduan ini adalah jalur lengkap memindahkan aplikasi CodeIgniter 3 ke Kodhe Framework . Prinsip besarnya: Kodhe bukan framework baru yang harus dipelajari dari nol — ia adalah library library CI3 yang dimodernisasi menjadi paket Composer ber namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\ , dibungkus kernel compatibility layer agar kode CI3 lama tetap berjalan. Anda boleh bermigrasi bertahap , modul per modul. Bacaan terkait: peta namespace · arsitektur · instalasi · menjalankan aplikasi · troubleshooting 0. Strategi: dua jalur, boleh dicampur Jalur Cocok untuk Cara A. Compat layer (big bang ringan) Aplikasi CI3 besar, ingin cepat jalan lagi di PHP 8 Pasang kernel framework/, jalankan controller/model CI3 apa adanya; loader $CI load library() tetap berfungsi + alias CI otomatis B. Paket murni (incremental) Kode baru / refactor bertahap composer require kodhe/<paket lalu pakai kelas PSR 4 langsung (use Kodhe\\Framework\\...) tanpa loader Rekomendasi: mulai dari A supaya aplikasi hidup lagi, lalu pindahkan modul per modul ke B . Keduanya bisa berjalan berdampingan dalam satu aplikasi (loader dual mode — lihat arsitektur). 1. Prasyarat & audit kode lama Sebelum menyentuh composer, audit dulu: Pastikan aplikasi CI3 asli sudah jalan di PHP 8.1+ dengan error reporting strict — perbaiki dulu deprecated warning warisan PHP 7 (variabel tak terdefinisi, strlen(null), dll.) sebelum menambah lapisan migrasi. 2. Instalasi Detail di instalasi. Ringkasnya: Struktur folder aplikasi CI3 (application/config, controllers, models, views, migrations) tidak berubah — kernel membacunya apa adanya. ⚠️ Tetapi perhatikan: Kodhe juga punya konvensi struktur sendiri untuk kode baru — folder PascalCase tanpa underscore (app/Controllers/, app/Models/) dan sistem router ganda (modern + legacy) yang perilakunya berbeda dari CI3. Ini adalah isu nyata saat migrasi bertahap; seluruh pemetaannya beserta strategi koeksistensi ada di Struktur Folder & Router , dan standar penulisan tiap komponen (controller/model/library/view) beserta konversi per file ada di Komponen Aplikasi Standar . 3. Bootstrap aplikasi Ganti bootstrap pada index.php. CI3: Kodhe (mode kernel): Mode paket murni tidak butuh bootstrap sama sekali — cukup require 'vendor/autoload.php' lalu instantiate kelas yang dibutuhkan (lihat running.md § Mode paket murni). Application mensyaratkan paket kodhe/http; bila belum terpasang Anda akan mendapat RuntimeException dengan instruksi composer require kodhe/http. 4. Konfigurasi: array CI3 diterima apa adanya Kernel membaca konfigurasi gaya CI3 (config.php, database.php) dan menerjemahkannya ke service container (framework/src/Config/Setup.php). Anda TIDAK perlu menulis ulang file config. Yang wajib dicek/diubah: Kunci CI3 Status di Kodhe base url, index page, uri protocol ✅ sama sess driver, sess cookie name, sess expiration ✅ sama; sess save path wajib terisi (nama tabel utk driver database, folder utk files) $db['default'] (hostname, username, …) ✅ sama; driver mysqli/pdo encryption key ⚠️ hanya relevan utk paket encrypt lama; encryption modern memakai key sendiri — lihat encrypt.md 5. Peta namespace & loader Ini inti migrasi. Tabel lengkap nama loader → FQCN → paket ada di peta migrasi namespace . Pola umumnya: CI3 asli Kodhe (kode baru) CI Session, $this load library('session') Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\Drivers\\ CI Form validation Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation (paket kodhe/validation) CI Pagination Kodhe\\Framework\\Pagination\\Pagination CI Email Kodhe\\Framework\\Email\\Email CI Upload Kodhe\\Framework\\Upload\\Upload CI Image lib Kodhe\\Framework\\Image\\Image $this db … (query builder) Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\ Kodhe\\Session\\Session (legacy Kodhe) ❌ usang — selalu pakai prefix Kodhe\\Framework\\ Aturan praktis: 1. Kode lama $this load library('x') tetap jalan via compat layer — jangan sentuh dulu; biarkan loader me resolve lewat packageMap. 2. Kode baru selalu use Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\<Class ; — jangan pernah menulis CI atau"}, {"url": "id/concepts/namespaces-migration.html", "title": "Migrasi Namespace (CI3 → Kodhe Framework)", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Migrasi Namespace (CI3 → Kodhe Framework) Halaman ini adalah peta referensi nama . Untuk prosedur migrasi lengkap langkah demi langkah (instalasi, bootstrap, config, checklist verifikasi, rollback), lihat Migrasi dari CodeIgniter 3. Ada tiga generasi namespace. Kode aplikasi modern cukup mengenal yang ketiga. Generasi Contoh Status CI3 asli CI Session, $this load library('session') Masih jalan via alias loader Legacy Kodhe Kodhe\\Session\\Session, Kodhe\\Library\\ Usang — tidak ter autoload, jangan ditulis baru Aktif (PSR 4) Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\DatabaseDriver dst. ✅ Standar semua paket Peta nama library loader → kelas aktif Loader lama ($CI load library('<nama ')) memetakan ke: Nama loader Kelas aktif Paket composer user agent, agent Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\UserAgent kodhe/agent form validation Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation kodhe/validation pagination Kodhe\\Framework\\Pagination\\Pagination kodhe/pagination email Kodhe\\Framework\\Email\\Email kodhe/email session driver di Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\Drivers\\ kodhe/session image lib Kodhe\\Framework\\Image\\Image (+Drivers\\GdDriver) kodhe/image upload Kodhe\\Framework\\Upload\\Upload kodhe/upload database Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\ kodhe/database table Kodhe\\Framework\\Table\\Table kodhe/table parser Kodhe\\Framework\\Parser\\ kodhe/parser encrypt / encryption Kodhe\\Framework\\Encrypt\\ / Encryption\\ kodhe/encrypt, kodhe/encryption ftp Kodhe\\Framework\\Ftp\\Ftp kodhe/ftp zip Kodhe\\Framework\\Zip\\Zip kodhe/zip calendar Kodhe\\Framework\\Calendar\\Calendar kodhe/calendar cart Kodhe\\Framework\\Cart\\Cart kodhe/cart typography Kodhe\\Framework\\Typography\\Typography kodhe/typography javascript Kodhe\\Framework\\Javascript\\Javascript kodhe/javascript migration Kodhe\\Framework\\Migration\\Migration kodhe/migration trackback Kodhe\\Framework\\Trackback\\Trackback kodhe/trackback xmlrpc / xmlrpcs Kodhe\\Framework\\Xmlrpc\\ / Xmlrpcs\\ kodhe/xmlrpc, kodhe/xmlrpcs profiler Kodhe\\Framework\\Profiler\\Profiler kodhe/profiler cache factory Kodhe\\Framework\\Cache\\ kodhe/cache Aturan penulisan kode baru 1. Selalu use Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\<Class ; — jangan pernah menulis Kodhe\\Library\\ atau Kodhe\\<Paket \\<Class (tanpa Framework). 2. Jangan mengandalkan alias CI ; itu hanya safety net untuk kode warisan. 3. Bila muncul Class \"Kodhe\\<X \\<Y \" not found: kelas legacy tidak autoload — ganti ke FQCN pada tabel di atas dan jalankan composer dump autoload. Perubahan API kecil saat migrasi Sebagian method dinormalisasi camelCase, mis. Email: reply to() → replyTo(), set mailtype() digantikan opsi config; Session DB memakai kolom skema CI3 baru (timestamp, bukan lastactivity — fallback gc masih mendukung yang lama). Selalu cek README paket untuk signature final."}, {"url": "id/concepts/security.html", "title": "Keamanan (Security)", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Keamanan (Security) Halaman ini membahas fitur keamanan yang didukung Kodhe Framework saat ini: XSS filtering, CSRF protection, input filtering, password hashing, enkripsi data, cookie & session yang aman, rate limiting, serta validasi input. Setiap bagian menyertakan cara migrasi dari CodeIgniter 3 bila relevan. Semua API di bawah telah diverifikasi terhadap kode sumber paket (framework/src/Support/Legacy/, http/src/, session/src/, encrypt/src/). 1. Ringkasan cepat Kebutuhan Solusi Kodhe Status vs CI3 XSS cleaning Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Legacy\\Security::xss clean() + helper global xss clean() ✅ identik CI3 CSRF Config csrf protection dkk., diverifikasi otomatis oleh Input legacy; untuk router modern buat middleware sendiri ⚠️ sebagian (lihat §3.4) Input filtering $this input post('x', true) (flag xss clean) ✅ identik CI3 Password hashing password hash() / password verify() bawaan PHP (+ polyfill compat) ✅ sama Enkripsi data Paket kodhe/encrypt — Kodhe\\Framework\\Encrypt\\Encrypt ✅ + metode migrate() Cookie aman config cookie secure, cookie httponly; session cookie httponly=true default ✅ sama Rate limiting RateLimiter + middleware ThrottleRequests (router modern) 🆕 baru, tidak ada di CI3 Validasi input FormValidation (kompat CI3) atau paket kodhe/validation modern ✅ dua jalur CAPTCHA helper create captcha() ✅ port CI3 2. XSS Filtering 2.1 API Kernel kompatibel menyediakan kelas yang merupakan port langsung CI Security: Method yang tersedia: xss clean(), sanitize filename(), entity decode(), strip image tags(), get random bytes(), xss hash(). Helper global (muat dengan $this load helper('security')): 2.2 Global XSS filtering (perilaku CI3) Seperti CI3, input legacy menerapkan XSS clean per request lewat flag kedua: Rekomendasi : jangan mengandalkan penyaringan global. Simpan data mentah, lalu escape saat output (htmlentities() / engine view). xss clean cocok untuk input rich text yang memang akan dirender. 2.3 Migrasi dari CI3 Pola CI3 tetap jalan apa adanya di kernel kompatibel: Untuk kode baru, panggil kelasnya langsung (new Security(...)) atau helper global — tidak perlu $this load library('security'). 3. CSRF Protection 3.1 Konfigurasi (config.php — format CI3 diterima langsung) 3.2 Cara kerja (kernel kompatibel) Diverifikasi di Legacy/Input.php: saat Input dibangun dan csrf protection aktif, semua request POST otomatis melewati Security::csrf verify() — sama seperti CI3. Token yang tidak valid menghasilkan error 403 (\"The action you have requested is not allowed.\"). Di dalam form, sisipkan token persis pola CI3: URI yang dikecualikan dicocokkan dengan preg match(' ^'.$excluded.'$ i') terhadap uri string(). 3.3 AJAX Untuk request AJAX, kirim token pada header dan baca nilainya seperti CI3 — pastikan csrf cookie name dapat dibaca JS (jika butuh non httpOnly untuk cookie token), atau sertakan hash di respons JSON awal. 3.4 Router modern (kodhe/http) ⚠️ Known issue : router modern (Route:: / kodhe/http) tidak memiliki middleware CSRF bawaan — verifikasi CSRF hanya terjadi pada pipeline Input legacy. Untuk aplikasi murni modern: 1. Buat middleware sendiri (mis. App\\Middleware\\CsrfMiddleware) yang menginstansiasi Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Legacy\\Security lalu memanggil csrf verify() pada method POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE. 2. Daftarkan aliasnya di app/Config/middleware.php (dibaca MiddlewareRegistry — kunci aliases, groups, priority). 3. Pasang ke grup/rute: Route::group(...) middleware('csrf'). 3.5 Migrasi dari CI3 Tidak ada perubahan yang diperlukan: keenam kunci config di §3.1 dibaca langsung oleh kernel, dan $this security get csrf hash() tetap tersedia. Yang berubah hanya jika Anda pindah ke routing modern penuh — lihat §3.4. 4. Password Hashing Gunakan fungsi native PHP — tersedia langsung di PHP 8, dan paket menyediakan polyfill compat (Support/Legacy/compat/password.php) untuk lingkungan lama: Migrasi dari CI3 : sama persis — CI3 juga memakai password hash(). Data hash lama (prefix $2y$) tetap bisa diverifikasi. Jangan simpan pa"}, {"url": "id/concepts/services-modules-routing.html", "title": "Service, Modul, Routing Modern & Facade", "section": "id/concepts", "text": "Service, Modul, Routing Modern & Facade Halaman ini melengkapi dokumentasi fitur fitur bawaan Kodhe Framework (kernel framework/ + paket kodhe/http) yang belum tercakup di halaman lain: service container & service provider (addon), sistem modul, routing modern (Route::), middleware, dan facade global. Semua API di bawah diverifikasi dari kode sumber: framework/src/Container, framework/src/Foundation/Service, framework/src/Support/Modules.php, http/src/Routing, http/src/Middleware, framework/src/Support/Facades. Terkait pemindahan aplikasi lama, lihat Migrasi dari CI3 dan Struktur Folder & Router. 1. Service Container (Kodhe\\Framework\\Container\\Container) Container adalah registry dependency injection dengan penamaan berprefix . Setiap service disimpan sebagai string \"prefix:Nama\"; bila prefix tidak ditulis, container otomatis memakai prefix native kodhe: (Container::NATIVE PREFIX). Catatan implementasi (sesuai kode): make() dipanggil variadic: argumen ekstra diteruskan ke closure/factory. make() juga menerima bentuk make($bindingObjek, $nama, ...$args) untuk resolve lewat sub binding tertentu. Interface kontrak: BindingInterface (register, bind, registerSingleton, make); dekorator ConcreteBinding meneruskan ke delegate bila nama tidak ditemukan lokal. Error tidak ditemukan dilambungkan via Exceptions\\ContainerException::notFound($id, $availableServices) (memuat daftar service yang tersedia dalam pesannya). 2. ServiceProvider / ServiceLocator / ServiceManager (sistem Addon) Satu set kelas di Kodhe\\Framework\\Foundation\\Service untuk memaketkan fitur sebagai addon/modul mandiri (pola warisan ExpressionEngine style): Kelas Peran ServiceLocator Registry provider: register($prefix, $provider), has, get, all — duplikat prefix → Exception(\"Addon of name {$prefix} already registered.\") ServiceProvider Base class per addon; membaca array dari file setup, mendaftarkan namespace autoload, services, singletons, models, aliases ServiceManager Orkestrasi: scan folder addon, addProvider(), kumpulkan data lintas provider (forward()) ServiceHelper Akses statis service dengan auto detection prefix 2.1 File setup addon Sebuah addon adalah folder berisi addon.setup.php yang mengembalikan array : Aturan yang ditegakkan kode (ServiceProvider::registerServices): Nama service tidak boleh mengandung : (dipakai sebagai separator prefix). Service ter register dengan kunci \"{addon}:{Nama}\" di container; method register/registerSingleton/make pada provider selalu memaksa prefix lewat ensurePrefix() (khusus nama App dipetakan ke kodhe:App). string pada services dibungkus refleksi:实例iasi kelas namespace\\Kelas dengan argumen sisa. aliases numeric key memicu pemetaan Kodhe\\Modules... → alias Modules...; untuk alias CI versi lowercase (CI model) ikut didaftarkan agar aman di Linux case sensitive. 2.2 Registrasi runtime Konflik prefix: provider yang sudah ada tidak ditimpa , kecuali path lama berisi Addons/pro/levelups atau ExpressionEngine/Addons (prioritas pro/first party — logika internal addProvider()). 2.3 Mengakses service: ServiceHelper & helper service() Konversi nama (methodToServiceName): underscore di strip lalu ucwords, suffix Service ditambahkan bila belum ada. Resolusi memakai kodhe('App') (instance Application/provider root) — artinya helper ini aktif hanya bila kernel/bootstrap Kodhe sudah berjalan ; pada mode per paket murni, pakai Container::make() langsung. 3. Sistem Modul (Kodhe\\Framework\\Support\\Modules) Modul = folder aplikasi mandiri di bawah APPPATH.'modules/' (bisa lokasi lain via config modules locations) dengan struktur gaya CI3 HMVC: controllers/ models/ views/ config/ (routes.php). 3.1 Siklus hidup Modules::init() — panggil sekali saat bootstrap: menentukan locations, mencoba cache, lalu scanAndCacheAllModules(). Router modern (Router, UnifiedRouter) memanggilnya otomatis di konstruktor. Cache hasil scan disimpan di file cache (cache(), loadFromCache(), isCacheFresh($maxAge=3600), refreshCache(), clearCache()) — penting di produksi k"}, {"url": "id/general/crud-generator.html", "title": "Generator CRUD (make:crud)", "section": "id/general", "text": "Generator CRUD (make:crud) php console make:crud <NamaResource membuat satu set lengkap CRUD dalam satu perintah — seperti php artisan make: di framework modern. Hasil generate nya bisa mengikuti gaya yang Anda pilih: Gaya routing : kodhe (router modern, Route::resource) dan/atau CI3 (legacy $route[...]) — via style. Engine view : PHP native khas CI3 ( .php) atau Blade ( .blade.php) — via engine. Route otomatis didaftarkan ke file konfigurasi proyek, jadi tidak ada lagi edit manual setelah generate. Cocok untuk: memindahkan cepat satu entitas dari aplikasi CI3, atau membuat modul admin baru (list → create → edit → show → delete) di proyek Kodhe. 1. Sintaks Bagian Keterangan <NamaResource Wajib. UpperCamelCase , bentuk tunggal: Post, Article, ProductTag field:tipe Opsional, boleh banyak. Daftar kolom tabel + model. Contoh: title:string body:text published:bool style=kodhe\\ ci3\\ both Gaya route yang didaftarkan otomatis (default: both). kodhe → app/Config/routes modern.php, ci3 → app/Config/routes.php engine=php\\ blade Engine view hasil generate (default: php). blade menghasilkan .blade.php yang me resolve lewat ViewFactory Kodhe force Timpa file yang sudah ada (default: generator berhenti tanpa menulis apa pun bila ada konflik) path= Lokasi output custom (opsi global make: ) Alias invocation yang sama: php console g:crud Post, php console generate crud Post. Tipe field yang dikenali Ditulis Jadi kolom (migration Forge) Catatan string (default) VARCHAR(255) Salah ketik tipe apa pun otomatis di fallback ke string text TEXT integer / int INT(9) boolean / bool TINYINT(1) date / datetime / decimal sesuai namanya Kolom id (auto increment primary key) serta created at/updated at (DATETIME) ditambahkan otomatis — jangan deklarasikan ulang. Tanpa daftar field, generator memakai contoh default name:string. 2. Artefak yang dihasilkan Contoh: php console make:crud Article title:string slug:string body:text published:bool File Isi app/Models/Article.php Model extends Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model (ORM CI3 compatible). $table = 'articles', $useTimestamps = true, dan $allowedFields terisi otomatis dari daftar field (tanpa id) sehingga mass assignment insert()/update() langsung aman dipakai app/Controllers/ArticleController.php Controller extends Kodhe\\Framework\\Http\\Controllers\\BaseController dengan aksi penuh: index create store show edit update delete. Nama class diberi suffix Controller agar tidak bentrok dengan Model bernama sama database/migrations/<timestamp create articles table.php Migration anonymous class up()/down() memakai stack database modern : Loader::dbforge(kodhe() db, true) + add field/add key/create table (bukan CI::load dbutil legacy) app/Views/articles/index.php Tabel listing + tombol Show/Edit/Delete (ekstensi .blade.php bila engine=blade) app/Views/articles/create.php Form tambah (POST ke resource) app/Views/articles/edit.php Form ubah (POST ke update/{id}) app/Views/articles/show.php Detail satu record app/Views/articles/ form.php Field form bersama — sudah terisi otomatis sesuai daftar field:tipe yang Anda deklarasikan (<input /<textarea /<select per kolom, lengkap dengan nilai lama untuk mode edit) app/Config/routes modern.php (jika style=kodhe/both) Route modern ditambahkan otomatis: Route::resource(...) + rute POST update/{id} dan DELETE {id} yang menunjuk method controller hasil generate app/Config/routes.php (jika style=ci3/both) Peta $route['articles/...'] gaya CI3 ditambahkan otomatis (7 pola URI: index/create/store/show/edit/update/delete) Penamaan otomatis: tabel = snake case jamak (ProductTag → product tags), segmen URL = kebab case jamak (/product tags). Pluralizer masih sederhana — cek ulang nama tabel/URL untuk kata tak beraturan (mis. Category → categories benar, tetapi istilah teknis asing bisa salah) dan sesuaikan bila perlu. 3. Route otomatis ( style) & engine view ( engine) Generator langsung mendaftarkan route sesuai gaya yang dipilih — tidak perlu edit manual lagi. File tujuan dibuat otomatis bila"}, {"url": "id/general/new-project.html", "title": "Membuat Proyek Baru (php console new)", "section": "id/general", "text": "Membuat Proyek Baru (php console new) Perintah new pada Kodhe Console mem scaffold kerangka aplikasi Kodhe Framework yang siap jalan: struktur folder standar (PascalCase, tanpa ), composer.json dengan PSR 4 App\\, file bootstrap, konfigurasi, template .env, plus kode starter (controller/model/view/route) sehingga php console serve langsung berfungsi. Dokumen ini mencakup perintah new dan serve yang menjadi pasangan baku untuk memulai proyek secara lokal. 1. Prasyarat Kebutuhan Keterangan PHP = 8.1 Composer untuk memasang dependensi setelah scaffold Kodhe Console tersedia dari checkout framework (bin/console) atau dari paket kodhe/framework Anda tidak perlu proyek existing — new membuat direktori target dari nol. 2. Perintah dasar Alias yang dikenali: new:project, create project. Opsi Opsi Fungsi force Scaffold ke dalam direktori yang sudah ada dan tidak kosong (file hasil generate akan menimpa file bernama sama) min Kerangka minimal: hanya folder + config, tanpa kode demo (Home controller, Base model, view welcome). Sebagai gantinya dibuat file .gitkeep di folder kosong Contoh: Jika direktori target sudah berisi file dan force tidak diberikan, perintah berhenti dengan pesan error dan exit code 1. 3. Struktur hasil generate Catatan penting: Nama proyek di composer.json diturunkan dari nama folder (huruf kecil, karakter ilegal → ), prefix tetap app/<nama . console milik proyek mencari vendor/autoload.php di root proyek (fallback satu level ke atas), jadi ia bekerja setelah composer install. Konvensi folder mengikuti standar Kodhe: PascalCase, tanpa underscore (lihat folder structure and routing). 4. Isi konfigurasi bawaan .env SESS SAVE PATH wajib menunjuk folder yang dapat ditulis saat memakai driver session file — nilai default storage/Session sudah disediakan. app/Config/config.php Berisi default aman untuk pengembangan: index page kosong (URL bersih), router modern aktif berdampingan dengan legacy router, dan cache routes hanya enabled saat ENVIRONMENT === 'production'. Routes routes.php — gaya CI3: $route['default controller'] = 'Home/index'; dilayani legacy router. routes modern.php — gaya fluent: Route::get('/', 'App\\Controllers\\Home@index'); Router modern diperiksa lebih dulu ketika enable modern routing aktif, sehingga kedua file bisa koeksisten. Detail: services modules routing. Kode starter App\\Controllers\\Home extends BaseController dengan method index() (menampilkan view('home/index', ...)) dan hello(string $name) — cukup untuk memverifikasi routing, controller, dan view berjalan sebelum Anda menulis kode sendiri. Standar penulisan komponen: app components. 5. Menjalankan server dev (serve) Opsi Default Keterangan host= localhost Antarmuka/address binding (mis. 0.0.0.0 agar diakses dari jaringan) port= 8080 Port TCP; validasi 1–65535, selain itu error Di balik layar serve menjalankan PHP built in server dengan public/index.php sebagai router script, sehingga semua request masuk lewat front controller. Contoh: Script composer juga tersedia: composer serve. 6. Alur cepat dari nol sampai halaman pertama Lanjutkan mengembangkan dengan generator kode: Daftar lengkap perintah scaffold: cli console. Panduan step by step generator CRUD: generator crud. 7. Catatan & keterbatasan new tidak menjalankan composer install otomatis — dependensi dipasang manual sesuai instruksi \"Next steps\" yang dicetak perintah. File yang digenerate ditimpa diam diam bila sudah ada (khususnya saat force); commit/backup dulu direktori target Anda. Untuk migrasi proyek CI3 yang sudah ada (bukan proyek baru), jangan pakai new; ikuti prosedur migrating from ci3 — new berguna untuk menyiapkan kerangka Kodhe murni sebagai tujuan migrasi. Lihat juga: installation · running · troubleshooting"}, {"url": "id/general/running.html", "title": "Menjalankan Aplikasi", "section": "id/general", "text": "Menjalankan Aplikasi Bootstrap minimum (mode kernel CI3 compat) Application membutuhkan paket kodhe/http (Kernel, Request, Response). Bila belum terpasang, constructor gagal dengan pesan jelas dan saran composer require kodhe/http. Kernel membaca konfigurasi gaya CI3 (base url, sess driver, $db['default'], …) lalu mendaftarkan service melalui container (framework/src/Config/Setup.php). Akses container bila perlu resolve manual: $app getContainer() get('session'). Mode paket murni (tanpa kernel) Bila tidak butuh compat layer, pakai paket langsung seperti library biasa: Server development Untuk XAMPP/Laragon (/var/www/html/...): pastikan DocumentRoot menunjuk folder public/ (bukan root repo), dan index.html bawaan tidak menutupi index.php. Checklist sebelum deploy dev 1. composer install no dev (atau composer dump autoload o bila vendor sudah ada). 2. Konfigurasi session: sess driver + sess save path TIDAK boleh kosong — lihat troubleshooting. 3. Tabel database pendukung dibuat (sessions, ci migrations) sesuai README paket. 4. .env/config credential tidak ikut ke git."}, {"url": "id/general/troubleshooting.html", "title": "Troubleshooting", "section": "id/general", "text": "Troubleshooting Kumpulan pesan error yang paling sering muncul di pengembangan, beserta penyebab dan solusinya. Semua sudah punya fix di framework — update repo Anda terlebih dahulu (git pull + composer dump autoload). 1. Class \"Kodhe\\UserAgent\\UserAgent\" not found (atau Kodhe\\<X \\<Y lain) Penyebab : kode/config memakai namespace legacy tanpa prefix Framework yang tidak terdaftar di autoload. Solusi : ganti ke FQCN aktif — lihat peta migrasi. Contoh: Kodhe\\UserAgent\\UserAgent → Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\UserAgent. Loader $CI load library('user agent') sudah memperbaiki pemetaannya sejak PR 194. 2. Unknown column 'data' in 'SELECT' (session database) Penyebab : tabel session tidak memakai skema CI3 modern. Solusi : buat tabel sesuai README paket session: lalu isi $config['sess save path'] = 'ci sessions';. Driver kini memvalidasi skema dan memberi pesan jelas bila kolom kurang (PR 192). Kolom warisan lama lastactivity tetap didukung untuk garbage collection. 3. Unable to inspect session table '' / strcspn(): Argument 1 ... null given Penyebab : sess save path kosong/null saat sess driver = database. Solusi : isi nama tabel pada config (lihat 2). Framework kini fail fast dengan pesan eksplisit alih alih TypeError membingungkan (PR 192/ 196). Untuk dev cepat, pakai 'sess driver' = 'files', 'sess save path' = sys get temp dir(). 4. Error \"Cannot resolve class ...\" di paket Penyebab : biasanya autoload composer belum di regenerate setelah pindah folder/branch, atau file helper bootstrap tidak termuat. Solusi : jalankan composer dump autoload lalu composer test; hasil nyata per paket tercatat di issue 148– 175. 5. index.html menutupi aplikasi Root repo/app kadang berisi index.html bawaan; arahkan DocumentRoot ke folder public/ atau hapus file tersebut."}, {"url": "id/index.html", "title": "Panduan Pengguna Kodhe Framework (User Guide)", "section": "id", "text": "<! Daftar isi per bahasa untuk panduan pengguna Bahasa Indonesia (folder id/). File ini adalah \"README per bahasa\" nya panduan Bahasa Indonesia: dirender oleh scripts/build user guide.py menjadi html/id/index.html. Padanan bahasa Inggris ada di ../en/index.md; halaman pengantar dua bahasa ada di ../README.md. Semua tautan relatif di bawah adalah path repo biasa — berfungsi baik di GitHub (user guide/id/index.md) maupun di situs HTML hasil build. <! LANG SWITCH Panduan Pengguna Kodhe Framework (User Guide) Dokumentasi untuk pengembangan aplikasi di atas Kodhe Framework, disusun mengikuti struktur Panduan Pengguna CodeIgniter 3 — berisi general topics , library reference per paket, dan halaman index bertautan di setiap sub folder. Folder ini (id/) adalah versi lengkap Bahasa Indonesia; versi bahasa Inggris ada di ../en/index.md. Struktur Per Bahasa User guide ini terdiri dari dua folder bahasa , masing masing berisi panduan sesuai bahasanya: Folder Bahasa Isi ../en/index.md 🇬🇧 English concepts/, general/, libraries/ — fully translated ✅ id/ 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia concepts/, general/, libraries/ Struktur path kedua folder identik (mis. id/libraries/session.md ↔ en/libraries/session.md), sehingga tautan silang antar bahasa selalu tersedia di situs HTML hasil scripts/build user guide.py (pemilih ID · EN di header). Perbedaan utama dengan CI3: setiap library adalah paket Composer terpisah dengan namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\ . Anda cukup memasang paket yang dibutuhkan; tidak ada lagi $this load library() wajib untuk semua fitur. Daftar Isi Konsep Inti (concepts/) Dokumen Isi arsitektur Model modular paket, loader dual mode, service container instalasi Composer per paket vs root install, autoload PSR 4, requirement PHP app components Standar komponen aplikasi Kodhe : controller (App\\Controllers), model (Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model), library & view/template multi engine — plus cara migrasi tiap komponen dari CI3 migrasi dari ci3 Panduan langkah demi langkah memindahkan aplikasi CI3 (strategi, bootstrap, konfigurasi, checklist verifikasi, rollback) folder structure and routing ⚠️ Perbedaan struktur folder Kodhe (Controllers/, tanpa ) vs CI3, router ganda modern + legacy, strategi koeksistensi services modules routing Container layanan & provider, sistem modul, routing modern, facade cli console Console CLI modern (Console::getInstance(), base Command, make: ) + migrasi job cron is cli() CI3 keamanan 🔐 XSS, CSRF (konfigurasi + cara kerja di kernel & router modern), password hashing, enkripsi (migrate() untuk ciphertext CI3), cookie/session aman, rate limiting (RateLimiter/ThrottleRequests), validasi, CAPTCHA, checklist pra produksi namespaces migration Peta lengkap nama kelas CI / Kodhe\\Library\\ → Kodhe\\Framework\\ Topik Umum (general/) Dokumen Isi proyek baru Scaffold proyek dengan php console new + jalankan dev server (serve) generator crud 🚀 make:crud — satu perintah menghasilkan set CRUD lengkap (model, controller, migration, views) + tipe field, peta route, alur kerja menjalankan aplikasi Bootstrap framework, konfigurasi, menjalankan di server dev troubleshooting Pesan error umum & penyebabnya (class not found, skema tabel, dll.) Referensi Library (libraries/) Satu halaman per paket, format: tujuan → instalasi → Quick Start → API utama → catatan migrasi dari CI3 → tautan ke README paket (sumber kebenaran teknis). Kategori Paket Halaman Core Components loader (kernel) Loader (Kernel) Web Services http (request/response/middleware) HTTP Web Services view (template engine) View Database queries/builders Database Database migrations Migration General Topics session Session General Topics auth Auth General Topics socialite Socialite General Topics email Email General Topics encrypt/encryption Encrypt / Encryption General Topics cache Cache General Topics driver (driver system) Driver System Help & Validation form validation Form Validation Help & Validation pagination Pagination Third Party / RPC xmlrpc, xmlrpcs, trackback XML RPC &"}, {"url": "id/libraries/agent.html", "title": "Agent", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Agent Paket: kodhe/agent — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Agent\\ . Deteksi browser, platform, versi robot/mobile ala class CI Agent CodeIgniter 3. Instalasi Quick Start API utama Method Keterangan browser() / version() Nama & versi browser (lengkap dengan fallback) platform() / platform version() OS pengguna mobile() / is mobile() Nama perangkat mobile / boolean robot() / is robot() / robot referrer() Identifikasi crawler user agent() / referrer() / accept language() Nilai mentah header is browser($name) / is platform($name) Pencocokan spesifik Catatan migrasi dari CI3 $this load library('agent') → instansiasi new UserAgent($ SERVER) (atau lewat service container kernel bila tersedia). Semua method CI3 tetap ada dengan nama yang sama; return value tidak berubah. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/auth.html", "title": "Auth", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Auth Paket: kodhe/auth — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Auth\\ . Autentikasi session based + secure \"remember me\". Guard tidak menyentuh database langsung: lookup user didelegasikan ke UserProviderInterface implementasi aplikasi Anda. Instalasi Quick Start Tiga gaya pemakaian: objek Auth, Facade statis, atau helper auth(). Fitur utama Login/logout session based, re validasi storage tiap request (anti stale role) Remember me token acak; hanya hash SHA 256 yang disimpan, rotasi otomatis Throttling login (max attempts / lockout seconds) + timing equalized Registrasi (RegisterableProviderInterface), ganti & reset password (UpdatableProviderInterface, token sekali pakai kedaluwarsa) Verifikasi email (requestVerification / verifyEmail / isVerified) Event auth.login, auth.failed, auth.password reset, … via dispatcher opsional Method guard Keterangan attempt() / login() / logout() / check() Alur login dasar user() / id($key) / setUser() Data user aktif (hash password selalu dibuang) register() / changePassword() Manajemen akun sendPasswordReset() / resetPassword() Reset password requestVerification() / verifyEmail() / isVerified() Verifikasi email Catatan migrasi dari CI3 CI3 tidak punya auth bawaan — paket ini menjadi pengganti pola \"Ion auth / custom session\" yang umum, dengan hook extra pada attempt() untuk kondisi tambahan (mis. ['is active' = 1]). Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga session · Socialite"}, {"url": "id/libraries/cache.html", "title": "Cache", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Cache Paket: kodhe/cache — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Cache\\ . Penyimpanan cache multi driver (file, apc, redis, memcached, wincache, dev null) dengan API seragam, pengganti CI Cache. Instalasi Quick Start API utama Method Keterangan get($key) / save($key, $value, $ttl) / delete($key) Operasi dasar increment() / decrement() Counter clean() / invalidate() Bersihkan per pola / seluruhnya isAvailable() Cek kondisi driver Konfigurasi driver lain (redis/memcached: host, port, auth) lengkap di README. Catatan migrasi dari CI3 $this load driver('cache') → new Cache($config) langsung. Nama method CI3 (get, save, delete) tetap dikenali; driver bawaan CI3 yang tidak tersedia otomatis jatuh ke backup. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/calendar.html", "title": "Calendar", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Calendar Paket: kodhe/calendar — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Calendar\\ . Menghasilkan kalender HTML bulanan/mingguan/harian dengan template yang bisa dikustomisasi, setara CI Calendar. Instalasi Quick Start Mode & kustomisasi show() / month view default; week view($day) dan year view() tersedia. Template penuh lewat set template() (array bagian: table open, heading row, day cell, dst.) — key sama dengan CI3. get month name(), get day names() membantu render custom. Catatan migrasi dari CI3 Method lama (generate, show, week view, year view, set date, set template) dipertahankan; hanya cara memuat objek yang berubah. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/cart.html", "title": "Cart", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Cart Paket: kodhe/cart — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Cart\\ . Keranjang belanja session based ala Libraries/Cart CodeIgniter 3. Instalasi Quick Start API utama Method Keterangan insert($items) / update($items) / remove($rowid) Kelola item contents($newest first) Daftar item (array) total() / quantity() / subtotal() / tax() / shipping cost() Ringkasan harga destroy() Kosongkan keranjang Catatan migrasi dari CI3 Struktur array item dan key konfigurasi (cart product id, tax, shipping, dst.) identik dengan CI3 — hanya cara memuat objek yang berubah. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/database.html", "title": "Database", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Database Paket: kodhe/database (+ kodhe/driver sebagai abstraksi driver). Koneksi Query Builder (ala CI3) Driver Mysqli memvalidasi identifier secara aman (guard null sudah diperbaiki — tidak ada lagi TypeError strcspn() pada input kosong). Migration Gunakan paket terpisah kodhe/migration — lihat migration.md. Detail skema config penuh & transaksi: README paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/driver.html", "title": "Driver System", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Driver System Paket: kodhe/driver — sistem driver modular kompatibel PSR 4 untuk CodeIgniter 3, fondasi pattern CI Cache/CI Session style \"driver + library induk\". Instalasi Konsep Kelas Peran Contracts\\DriverInterface Kontrak tiap driver Contracts\\DriverLibraryInterface Kontrak library induk AbstractDriver Base class driver (config, dsb.) DriverLibrary Base class library induk (memilih & memakai driver) NullDriver Null object fallback saat driver gagal dimuat Resolvers\\DriverFileResolver Resolve & load file driver Registry\\DriverInstanceRegistry Cache instance driver (registry pattern) Quick Start Pola ini persis cara $this load driver('cache') bekerja di CI3 — gunakan saat menulis library baru yang butuh backend berganti ganti (queue, storage, payment gateway). Detail API lengkap: README paket"}, {"url": "id/libraries/email.html", "title": "Email", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Email Paket: kodhe/email — Kodhe\\Framework\\Email\\Email (mail/smtp/sendmail). Perubahan vs CI3: chaining fluent, reply to() → replyTo(), hasil debug lewat printDebugger(). Rincian: README paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/encrypt.html", "title": "Encryption", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Encryption Dua paket berbeda — jangan tertukar: Paket Kelas Kegunaan kodhe/encrypt Kodhe\\Framework\\Encrypt\\Encrypt Enkripsi CI3 lama (mcrypt era, kompatibilitas data existing) kodhe/encryption Kodhe\\Framework\\Encryption\\ Enkripsi modern berbasis OpenSSL — untuk data baru Aturan praktis: data lama didekripsi dengan encrypt, migrasikan lalu simpan ulang dengan encryption. Detail: README masing masing paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/ftp.html", "title": "FTP", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "FTP Paket: kodhe/ftp — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Ftp\\ . Klien FTP/FTPS: login, upload/download, manajemen direktori, setara CI Ftp. Instalasi Quick Start Operasi yang didukung login(), put()/upload(), get()/download(), cd(), pwd(), mkdir()/createdir(), rmdir()/deletedir(), rename(), delete file(), chmod file(), list file()/list contents(), debug(). Koneksi SSL lewat FtpSslConnection. Catatan migrasi dari CI3 API method lama dipertahankan; konfigurasi bisa dikirim lewat konstruktor alih alih $this load library('ftp', $config). Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/http.html", "title": "HTTP (Request / Response / Middleware)", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "HTTP (Request / Response / Middleware) Paket: kodhe/http. Middleware callable: implementasi MiddlewareInterface menerima $next; rantai dieksekusi bergaya onion. Dokumentasi penuh header, cookies, file upload request, dan daftar middleware bawaan: README paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/image.html", "title": "Image", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Image Paket: kodhe/image — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Image\\ . Manipulasi gambar (resize, crop, rotate, watermark) berbasis driver GD, setara CI Image lib. Instalasi Persyaratan: PHP = 8.1 dengan ekstensi gd. Quick Start Operasi yang didukung resize (maintain ratio), crop, rotate, flip/flop, grayscale, brightness, contrast, sharpening, dan watermark (wm penuh seperti CI3). Catatan migrasi dari CI3 $this load image($config) → new Image($config); key konfigurasi wm lama tetap diterima apa adanya. Driver lain (imagick) dapat ditambahkan melalui sistem driver paket kodhe/driver; bawaan tersedia GdDriver. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/index.html", "title": "Referensi Library (per Paket)", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Referensi Library (per Paket) Format tiap halaman sama seperti CI3 user guide: pengantar → instalasi → cara pakai → referensi method → catatan migrasi. Detail API final selalu di README paket masing masing (sumber kebenaran); halaman ini adalah jalur belajar. Kategori Paket Halaman Core Components loader (kernel) loader kernel.md Web Services http (request/response/middleware) http.md Web Services view (template engine) view.md Database queries/builders database.md Database migrations migration.md General Topics session session.md General Topics auth auth.md General Topics socialite socialite.md General Topics email email.md General Topics encrypt/encryption encrypt.md General Topics cache cache.md General Topics driver (driver system) driver.md Help & Validation form validation validation.md Help & Validation pagination pagination.md Utilities (ringkasan) semua paket utilitas utilities.md Utilities agent agent.md Utilities calendar calendar.md Utilities cart cart.md Utilities image image.md Utilities javascript javascript.md Utilities parser parser.md Utilities profiler profiler.md Utilities table table.md Utilities typography typography.md Utilities upload upload.md Utilities ftp ftp.md Utilities zip zip.md Third Party / RPC xmlrpc, xmlrpcs, trackback rpc trackback.md Testing unit test (via kernel test) testing.md Butuh paket yang halamannya belum ada? Buka issue — kontribusi dokumentasi mengikuti template halaman yang sudah ada."}, {"url": "id/libraries/javascript.html", "title": "Javascript", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Javascript Paket: kodhe/javascript — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Javascript\\ . Helper script jQuery/Prototype/JQueryLib ala CI Javascript — terutama untuk validasi form sisi klien. Instalasi Quick Start Catatan migrasi dari CI3 API lama (validation() dan helper lainnya) dipertahankan. Untuk proyek baru, pertimbangkan Constraint Validation bawaan browser atau library frontend Anda — paket ini tersedia utamanya untuk kompatibilitas aplikasi CI3 lama. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/loader-kernel.html", "title": "Loader & Kernel (Core Components)", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Loader & Kernel (Core Components) Kernel framework/ menyediakan pengalaman loading ala CI3 di atas paket modern. load library() / model() / helper() Pemetaan nama→kelas ada di FileLoader::packageMap() (sumber tunggal). Bila Anda menambah paket baru, daftarkan di sana agar loader legacy mengenalinya. Service Container & Setup Config/Setup.php membangun array konfigurasi layanan dari config aplikasi dan mendaftarkan factory per service ke Container. Accessor: Dual mode Seluruh framework berjalan dengan ATAU tanpa kernel: import kelas paket langsung (PSR 4 murni) selalu boleh dan disarankan untuk kode baru."}, {"url": "id/libraries/migration.html", "title": "Migration", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Migration Paket: kodhe/migration — Kodhe\\Framework\\Migration\\Migration. File migration = class Migration <timestamp dengan up()/down(). Konfigurasi tabel pelacak lewat constructor (tidak lagi butuh CI superobject). Lengkap: README paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/pagination.html", "title": "Pagination Library", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Pagination Library Paket: kodhe/pagination — kelas utama Kodhe\\Framework\\Pagination\\Pagination. Quick Start Inti API Method Fungsi initialize(array object $params) (re)konfigurasi instance create links(): string Render HTML link halaman cur page(): int Halaman aktif saat ini total pages(): int Jumlah halaman Renderer dapat diganti lewat config query string segment, page query string, dsb. Detail lengkap & contoh tema: README paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/parser.html", "title": "Parser", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Parser Paket: kodhe/parser — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Parser\\ . Template engine tag sederhana ala CI Parser: {name}, tag pair {entries} … {/entries}, dan conditional {else}. Instalasi Quick Start Method lain: parse string($template, $data) (render string, bukan file) dan associate() untuk mengisi tag dari hasil query database seperti CI3. Catatan migrasi dari CI3 $this load parser parse(...) → instansiasi Parser dengan opsi templatePath. Sintaks template lama ({var}, tag pair, {else}, conditional) tetap sama. Butuh engine modern (Blade/Twig) dalam satu API? Lihat paket view. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/profiler.html", "title": "Profiler", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Profiler Paket: kodhe/profiler — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Profiler\\ . Panel debug di akhir halaman: benchmark, query database, memory, URI, GET/POST, config, session, dan headers — penerus $config['enable profiler'] CodeIgniter 3. Instalasi Quick Start Seleksi seksi & renderer Arsitektur dimodularisasi menjadi collector per seksi (Collectors\\BenchmarkCollector, DatabaseCollector, dst.) dan renderer (Renderers\\HtmlRenderer / TextRenderer) — collector custom cukup mendaftarkan kelas baru. Catatan migrasi dari CI3 CI3 mengaktifkan profiler lewat konfigurasi global; di Kodhe Anda memanggil run() secara eksplisit sehingga bisa dibatasi per lingkungan (mis. hanya ketika ENVIRONMENT === 'development'). Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/rpc-trackback.html", "title": "XML-RPC & Trackback", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "XML RPC & Trackback xmlrpc (klien) — kodhe/xmlrpc xmlrpcs (server) — kodhe/xmlrpcs Daftarkan method pada application/config/xmlrpc.php seperti CI3; kelas Server mem parse request dan memanggil handler bertipe IXR . trackback — kodhe/trackback Validasi & kirim/penerima trackback ping; integrasi otomatis saat posting (jika dipakai). Detail: xmlrpc/README.md, xmlrpcs/README.md, trackback/README.md."}, {"url": "id/libraries/session.html", "title": "Session", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Session Paket: kodhe/session — driver di Kodhe\\Framework\\Session\\Drivers\\ (files, database; cookie/redis tersedia via konfigurasi kernel). Konfigurasi (ala CI3) Pemakaian Skema tabel (driver database) Lihat troubleshooting §2 untuk DDL lengkap. Driver memvalidasi kolom saat read() dan memberi pesan error jelas bila skema tidak cocok; gc() otomatis mendukung kolom warisan lastactivity. Detail API & opsi: README paket."}, {"url": "id/libraries/socialite.html", "title": "Socialite", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Socialite Paket: kodhe/socialite — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Socialite\\ . Login sosial OAuth native : protokol OAuth 1.0a & 2.0 diimplementasikan mandiri (bukan laravel/socialite, bukan Guzzle, bukan league/oauth2 client). Instalasi PHP = 8.1; ext curl disarankan (fallback otomatis ke PHP streams). Provider bawaan Provider Protokol Google OAuth 2 / OIDC GitHub OAuth 2 Facebook OAuth 2 (Graph v18) GitLab OAuth 2 (self hosted didukung) LinkedIn OAuth 2 / OIDC Twitter OAuth 1.0a (signing HMAC SHA1) Provider lain bisa didaftarkan lewat Manager::extend(). Quick Start Catatan Setelah memperoleh $user, aplikasi tetap bertanggung jawab find or create akun lokal lalu memanggil Auth::login(). Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga auth"}, {"url": "id/libraries/table.html", "title": "Table", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Table Paket: kodhe/table — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Table\\ . Menghasilkan HTML table dari array atau hasil query, setara CI Table. Instalasi Quick Start API utama Method Keterangan set heading() / set columns() Judul & nama kolom add row() / insert row() / clear() Baris tabel set template() Template HTML custom (key sama dengan CI3) set caption() / set empty() Caption & isi sel kosong generate($data = null) Render HTML table Catatan migrasi dari CI3 API identik dengan CI Table; hanya cara memuat objek yang berubah ($this load library('table') → new Table()). Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/testing.html", "title": "Testing", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Testing Framework memakai PHPUnit (lihat phpunit.xml root). Untuk unit test aplikasi: Prinsip pengujian paket ini: hampir semua kelas dapat di new langsung dengan array config (tanpa superobject CI) — dependency injection eksplisit membuat testing jauh lebih mudah dibanding CI3. PHPUnit adalah satu satunya tester resmi proyek ini (statis analyzer seperti PHPStan sudah dihapus agar tidak dobel)."}, {"url": "id/libraries/typography.html", "title": "Typography", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Typography Paket: kodhe/typography — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Typography\\ . Tipografi otomatis untuk teks, pengganti CI Typography. Instalasi Quick Start Catatan migrasi dari CI3 Nama method dan perilakunya dipertahankan mengikuti CI Typography; tidak ada perubahan konfigurasi. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/upload.html", "title": "Upload", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Upload Paket: kodhe/upload — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Upload\\ . Validasi dan pemindahan file upload, pengganti $ FILES manual ala CI Upload. Instalasi Quick Start API utama Method / properti Keterangan initialize($config) Set ulang konfigurasi do upload($field) Proses upload satu field data() Array informasi file hasil upload display errors() / errors() Pesan error string / array set filename() dll. Sama seperti CI3 (set allowed types, dsb.) Konfigurasi lengkap (mime check ketat, dimension limit, chmod, alias) ada di README paket. Catatan migrasi dari CI3 API sengaja dipertahankan identik — cukup ganti loading library dengan instansiasi kelas; tidak ada perubahan nama method. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/libraries/utilities.html", "title": "Utilities (Paket Pendukung)", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Utilities (Paket Pendukung) Halaman ringkas; tiap baris menaut ke README kanonik paket. Paket Kelas utama Quick note agent Agent\\UserAgent Deteksi browser/platform/mobile/robot; $CI agent browser() image Image\\Image + Drivers\\GdDriver resize/crop/rotate/watermark via GD upload Upload\\Upload Validasi & pemindahan file upload ftp Ftp\\Ftp Klien FTP (login, put/get, dir listing) zip Zip\\Zip Buat/ekstrak arsip ZIP table Table\\Table Generate HTML table dari array/query result parser Parser\\ Template tag pair {name} ala CI3 parser calendar Calendar\\Calendar Kalender HTML monthly/weekly/daily javascript Javascript\\Javascript Prototype/jQuery/JQueryLib helper JS typography Typography\\Typography autoyp, smart quotes, nl2br br profiler Profiler\\Profiler Section & collector debugging waktu/memory/query cache Factory cache File/apc/redis/memcached/wincache dev null cart Cart\\Cart Keranjang belanja session based Contoh umum (pilih salah satu untuk mulai):"}, {"url": "id/libraries/validation.html", "title": "Form Validation Library", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Form Validation Library Paket: kodhe/validation — kelas utama Kodhe\\Framework\\Validation\\FormValidation. Padanan CI Form validation CI3, API rules string identik. Instalasi Cara Pakai (pola CI3) Aturan Bawaan Populer required, matches, valid email, valid url, integer, numeric, min length[n], max length[n], exact length[n], alpha, alpha numeric, in list[a,b,c], is unique[table.field], callback method name, dst. Daftar lengkap + aturan custom: lihat README paket. Catatan Migrasi Pada controller CI3, $this form validation tetap tersedia via loader kernel — kode lama tidak perlu diubah. set value() ber docblock tipe lengkap (@return string array) sehingga aman untuk IDE dan analisis statis."}, {"url": "id/libraries/view.html", "title": "View", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "View Paket: kodhe/view — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\View\\ . Sistem template multi engine ( PHP native , Blade via eftec/bladeone, Twig ) dengan layout, tema, varian, dan manajemen aset — penerus CI Load bagian view. Instalasi Persyaratan: PHP = 8.1. Opsional: twig/twig bila memakai engine Twig. Quick Start Fitur: layout & section (extends/section), tema & varian (mobile/desktop), AssetManager untuk CSS/JS (inline, minify, grouping). Catatan migrasi dari CI3 $this load view('hal', $data) → $view render('hal', $data); file view .php lama tetap dirender tanpa perubahan. third party parser CI3 dapat diganti salah satu engine bawaan. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga parser"}, {"url": "id/libraries/zip.html", "title": "Zip", "section": "id/libraries", "text": "Zip Paket: kodhe/zip — namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\Zip\\ . Membuat dan membaca arsip ZIP tanpa ekstensi tambahan, pengganti CI Zip. Instalasi Quick Start Catatan migrasi dari CI3 $this load library('zip') → new Zip(). Penamaan method modern (addFile, addDir, archive, download) — padanan CI3 (read file, add data, zip file) terdokumentasi di README. Detail API lengkap: README paket · Lihat juga utilities"}, {"url": "id/index.html", "title": "Panduan Pengguna Kodhe Framework (User Guide)", "section": "id", "text": "<! Daftar isi per bahasa untuk panduan pengguna Bahasa Indonesia (folder id/). File ini adalah \"README per bahasa\" nya panduan Bahasa Indonesia: dirender oleh scripts/build user guide.py menjadi html/id/index.html. Padanan bahasa Inggris ada di ../en/index.md; halaman pengantar dua bahasa ada di ../README.md. Semua tautan relatif di bawah adalah path repo biasa — berfungsi baik di GitHub (user guide/id/index.md) maupun di situs HTML hasil build. <! LANG SWITCH Panduan Pengguna Kodhe Framework (User Guide) Dokumentasi untuk pengembangan aplikasi di atas Kodhe Framework, disusun mengikuti struktur Panduan Pengguna CodeIgniter 3 — berisi general topics , library reference per paket, dan halaman index bertautan di setiap sub folder. Folder ini (id/) adalah versi lengkap Bahasa Indonesia; versi bahasa Inggris ada di ../en/index.md. Struktur Per Bahasa User guide ini terdiri dari dua folder bahasa , masing masing berisi panduan sesuai bahasanya: Folder Bahasa Isi ../en/index.md 🇬🇧 English concepts/, general/, libraries/ — fully translated ✅ id/ 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia concepts/, general/, libraries/ Struktur path kedua folder identik (mis. id/libraries/session.md ↔ en/libraries/session.md), sehingga tautan silang antar bahasa selalu tersedia di situs HTML hasil scripts/build user guide.py (pemilih ID · EN di header). Perbedaan utama dengan CI3: setiap library adalah paket Composer terpisah dengan namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\ . Anda cukup memasang paket yang dibutuhkan; tidak ada lagi $this load library() wajib untuk semua fitur. Daftar Isi Konsep Inti (concepts/) Dokumen Isi arsitektur Model modular paket, loader dual mode, service container instalasi Composer per paket vs root install, autoload PSR 4, requirement PHP app components Standar komponen aplikasi Kodhe : controller (App\\Controllers), model (Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model), library & view/template multi engine — plus cara migrasi tiap komponen dari CI3 migrasi dari ci3 Panduan langkah demi langkah memindahkan aplikasi CI3 (strategi, bootstrap, konfigurasi, checklist verifikasi, rollback) folder structure and routing ⚠️ Perbedaan struktur folder Kodhe (Controllers/, tanpa ) vs CI3, router ganda modern + legacy, strategi koeksistensi services modules routing Container layanan & provider, sistem modul, routing modern, facade cli console Console CLI modern (Console::getInstance(), base Command, make: ) + migrasi job cron is cli() CI3 keamanan 🔐 XSS, CSRF (konfigurasi + cara kerja di kernel & router modern), password hashing, enkripsi (migrate() untuk ciphertext CI3), cookie/session aman, rate limiting (RateLimiter/ThrottleRequests), validasi, CAPTCHA, checklist pra produksi namespaces migration Peta lengkap nama kelas CI / Kodhe\\Library\\ → Kodhe\\Framework\\ Topik Umum (general/) Dokumen Isi proyek baru Scaffold proyek dengan php console new + jalankan dev server (serve) generator crud 🚀 make:crud — satu perintah menghasilkan set CRUD lengkap (model, controller, migration, views) + tipe field, peta route, alur kerja menjalankan aplikasi Bootstrap framework, konfigurasi, menjalankan di server dev troubleshooting Pesan error umum & penyebabnya (class not found, skema tabel, dll.) Referensi Library (libraries/) Satu halaman per paket, format: tujuan → instalasi → Quick Start → API utama → catatan migrasi dari CI3 → tautan ke README paket (sumber kebenaran teknis). Kategori Paket Halaman Core Components loader (kernel) Loader (Kernel) Web Services http (request/response/middleware) HTTP Web Services view (template engine) View Database queries/builders Database Database migrations Migration General Topics session Session General Topics auth Auth General Topics socialite Socialite General Topics email Email General Topics encrypt/encryption Encrypt / Encryption General Topics cache Cache General Topics driver (driver system) Driver System Help & Validation form validation Form Validation Help & Validation pagination Pagination Third Party / RPC xmlrpc, xmlrpcs, trackback XML RPC &"}, {"url": "en/index.html", "title": "Kodhe Framework User Guide", "section": "en", "text": "<! Per language table of contents for the English user guide (folder en/). This file is the \"README per bahasa\" of the English guide: rendered by scripts/build user guide.py to html/en/index.html and — because en is DEFAULT LANG — also to the root html/index.html. The Indonesian counterpart is ../id/index.md; the bilingual landing page is ../README.md. All relative links below are plain repo paths — they work both on GitHub (user guide/en/index.md) and in the built HTML site. <! LANG SWITCH Kodhe Framework User Guide Documentation for application development on top of the Kodhe Framework, organized following the CodeIgniter 3 User Guide structure — general topics , per package library reference , and linked index pages in every sub folder. This folder (en/) is the full English version; the Indonesian version lives in ../id/index.md. Structure by Language This user guide consists of two language folders , each containing a full guide in its own language: Folder Language Contents en/ 🇬🇧 English concepts/, general/, libraries/ — fully translated ✅ ../id/index.md 🇮🇩 Bahasa Indonesia concepts/, general/, libraries/ The path structure of both folders is identical (e.g. id/libraries/session.md ↔ en/libraries/session.md), so cross language links are always available in the HTML site built by scripts/build user guide.py ( ID · EN switcher in the header). Main difference vs CI3: every library is a separate Composer package with the namespace Kodhe\\Framework\\<Paket \\ . Install only the packages you need; there is no more mandatory $this load library() for every feature. Table of Contents Core Concepts (concepts/) Document Contents architecture Modular package model, dual mode loader, service container installation Per package Composer vs root install, PSR 4 autoload, PHP requirements app components Standard Kodhe application components : controllers (App\\Controllers), models (Kodhe\\Framework\\Database\\Model), libraries & multi engine views/templates — plus how to migrate each component from CI3 migrating from ci3 Step by step guide to moving a CI3 application (strategy, bootstrap, config, verification checklist, rollback) folder structure and routing ⚠️ Kodhe folder layout differences (Controllers/, no ) vs CI3, dual router (modern + legacy), coexistence strategy services modules routing Service container & providers, module system, modern routing, facades cli console Modern CLI Console (Console::getInstance(), base Command, make: ) + migrating CI3 is cli() cron jobs security 🔐 XSS, CSRF (config + how it works in the kernel & modern router), password hashing, encryption (migrate() for CI3 ciphertext), secure cookies/sessions, rate limiting (RateLimiter/ThrottleRequests), validation, CAPTCHA, pre production checklist namespaces migration Full CI / Kodhe\\Library\\ → Kodhe\\Framework\\ name map General Topics (general/) Document Contents new project Scaffold a project with php console new + run the dev server (serve) crud generator 🚀 make:crud — one command generates a complete CRUD set (model, controller, migration, views) + field types, route map, workflow running Framework bootstrap, configuration, running on the dev server troubleshooting Common error messages & their causes (class not found, table schema, etc.) Library Reference (libraries/) One page per package, format: purpose → installation → Quick Start → main API → migration notes from CI3 → link to the package README (source of technical truth). Category Package Page Core Components loader (kernel) Loader (Kernel) Web Services http (request/response/middleware) HTTP Web Services view (template engine) View Database queries/builders Database Database migrations Migration General Topics session Session General Topics auth Auth General Topics socialite Socialite General Topics email Email General Topics encrypt/encryption Encrypt / Encryption General Topics cache Cache General Topics driver (driver system) Driver System Help & Validation form validation Form Validation Help & Validation"}];